<!doctype lake><title>𝑮𝒆𝒏𝑨𝑰-𝑺𝒂𝒌𝒖𝒓𝒂-𝑰𝑰</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="nIwyk" id="nIwyk" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua2093470" id="ua2093470">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="ud24ec531" id="ud24ec531"> 𝐍𝐨𝐢𝐬𝐞 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐝𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥 𝐒𝐜𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐍𝐞𝐭𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐤</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u9e407e18" id="u9e407e18"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ab9ce82" id="u5ab9ce82" style="color: #000000">背景：生成建模是机器学习中的基础问题，广泛应用于图像生成、语音与音乐合成、半监督学习、异常检测、模仿学习以及强化学习等任务</span></strong></p><ul list="u942acae4"><li fid="ud8bc690c" data-lake-id="ue8d746f4" id="ue8d746f4"><span data-lake-id="ucc97c99f" id="ucc97c99f">生成模型的主流研究主要由两类方法推动：一类是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u84190d2b" id="u84190d2b">基于似然的方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u38275562" id="u38275562">，通过最大化对数似然或其代理目标来逼近真实数据分布；另一类是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u380af30d" id="u380af30d">生成对抗网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucba80820" id="ucba80820">，通过对抗训练缩小模型分布与真实分布之间的差异</span></li><li fid="ud8bc690c" data-lake-id="u1814b302" id="u1814b302"><span data-lake-id="u05044cb9" id="u05044cb9">基于似然的方法往往依赖可归一化的特殊结构，或者需要借助 ELBO、对比散度等替代目标进行训练</span></li><li fid="ud8bc690c" data-lake-id="uba311532" id="uba311532"><span data-lake-id="udac63fe8" id="udac63fe8">GAN 虽然在样本质量上表现突出，但训练过程不稳定，同时其目标函数本身也不适合用作严格、统一的模型比较标准。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udd513e39" id="udd513e39" style="color: #70000D">因此，如何寻找一种既不依赖对抗训练、又不受显式似然结构强约束的新型生成建模方式，成为一个重要问题</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1a038c06" id="u1a038c06"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud62070a2" id="ud62070a2">动机：基于上述背景，提出一个不同于传统似然建模与 GAN 的思路，不直接学习数据分布本身，而是学习数据对数密度的梯度，即 score 向量场</span></strong></p><ul list="u3ea4c7d0"><li fid="ub22b5165" data-lake-id="u650650b4" id="u650650b4"><span data-lake-id="u686f6535" id="u686f6535">其基本设想是，若能够准确估计数据分布在各点处朝向高密度区域的方向，便可以利用这一方向场，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b384eba" id="u5b384eba" style="color: #70000D">通过 Langevin dynamics 将随机初始化的样本逐步推向真实数据分布，从而完成生成</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uffc282ac" id="uffc282ac">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ude550609" id="ude550609" style="color: #00346B">但这一思路在高维真实数据上面临两个核心障碍</span></strong></li><li fid="ub22b5165" data-lake-id="u9d64c878" id="u9d64c878"><span data-lake-id="u6d87567c" id="u6d87567c">第一，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u415406a8" id="u415406a8" style="color: #2A4200">在流形假设下，真实数据通常集中在低维流形附近，这使得环境空间中的 score 可能不再良定义</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7b3c6153" id="u7b3c6153">，从而导致直接的 score matching 难以得到稳定、合理的估计</span></li><li fid="ub22b5165" data-lake-id="u2c4aa4d2" id="u2c4aa4d2"><span data-lake-id="u09cd2896" id="u09cd2896">第二，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u14a3affe" id="u14a3affe" style="color: #2A4200">在远离数据流形的低密度区域，由于训练样本稀疏，score 难以被准确学习</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u74a460e5" id="u74a460e5">，而采样过程恰恰常常需要从这些低密度区域出发，因此会进一步导致 Langevin dynamics 混合缓慢、跨模态（modes) 能力不足</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u974e3834" id="u974e3834"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc9c2cfa7" id="uc9c2cfa7" style="color: #000000">方法：为解决上述困难，作者提出一种基于多噪声尺度 score 学习与退火式 Langevin dynamics 的生成框架</span></strong></p><ul list="ubd513ace"><li fid="u0d6ec131" data-lake-id="u354f0c77" id="u354f0c77"><span data-lake-id="ua3aa5e75" id="ua3aa5e75">其核心做法是：不直接对原始数据分布学习 score，而是先对数据施加不同强度的高斯噪声扰动，使扰动后的分布具有更好的支撑性质，并在低密度区域提供更充分的训练信号。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u447f1cfd" id="u447f1cfd" style="color: #70000D">随后，训练一个噪声条件化的 score 网络，联合学习不同噪声级别下数据分布对应的 score 向量场</span></strong></li><li fid="u0d6ec131" data-lake-id="u77f8f3b6" id="u77f8f3b6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u43732567" id="u43732567" style="color: #2A4200">添加随机噪声可以确保生成的分布不会塌陷到低维流形上，大噪声水平会在原始数据的低密度区域产生样本，从而改善评分估计</span></strong></li><li fid="u0d6ec131" data-lake-id="uf90b0aae" id="uf90b0aae"><span data-lake-id="udd672167" id="udd672167">在采样阶段，进一步提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u93adbbb5" id="u93adbbb5">退火式 Langevin dynamics</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5c10d7b5" id="u5c10d7b5">。具体而言，生成过程不再只依赖单一噪声水平下的 score，而是从较大噪声级别开始进行采样，使样本先在平滑、易探索的分布上移动；再逐步降低噪声水平，使采样轨迹逐渐从粗糙的分布逼近到原始数据分布，最终贴近真实数据流形</span></li><li fid="u0d6ec131" data-lake-id="ufe1809d9" id="ufe1809d9"><span data-lake-id="u5c65e21d" id="u5c65e21d">主要优点：其训练目标具有良好的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u110e00c4" id="u110e00c4">可处理性与通用性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubc9db067" id="ubc9db067">，几乎适用于任意参数化的 score 网络，而不依赖特殊结构设计或额外约束；同时，训练过程中</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u44c192cc" id="u44c192cc">无需对抗训练、无需训练期 MCMC 采样，也无需其他近似技巧</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9da2b6c0" id="u9da2b6c0">，因而实现更为直接、稳定且易于优化。除此之外，该目标还能够作为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5644f015" id="u5644f015">统一的定量评价标准</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9a95c879" id="u9a95c879">，用于在同一数据集上比较不同模型的性能</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="VghlG" id="VghlG" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1ee74c39" id="u1ee74c39">🦉</span><span data-lake-id="u7299a7bb" id="u7299a7bb"> 𝑺𝒄𝒐𝒓𝒆-𝑩𝒂𝒔𝒆𝒅 𝑮𝒆𝒏𝒆𝒓𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒗𝒆 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒈</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua83f901e" id="ua83f901e"><span data-lake-id="u5c994e0d" id="u5c994e0d">设数据集由来自未知真实数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d6c4e1c5d9c24d87859de81ee160b17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R2oDi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ea732c7" id="u8ea732c7">的独立同分布样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EN%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F258b4a5876e741d226e719264ecc9704.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c30jJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u131eddeb" id="u131eddeb">构成。将概率密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3393d06da157e5e68d41cb15a41ef893.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Eew6J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b6e23e0" id="u4b6e23e0">的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u11267c54" id="u11267c54">score</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud95e410e" id="ud95e410e"> 定义为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90db310a9943c11bb9224c672269ac0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vAJSt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97767be0" id="u97767be0">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u73883950" id="u73883950">所谓 score network，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta%3A%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc16050db1f2b416fb9cd5942b8a738db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R1K7V%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u34800b10" id="u34800b10">是一个由参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f8f02fd1006c7ebfd3af79fe298d78e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DjTXF%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u20799f7a" id="u20799f7a">表示的神经网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5d20365f" id="u5d20365f">，其目标是逼近真实数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d6c4e1c5d9c24d87859de81ee160b17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fptic%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubae7c13d" id="ubae7c13d">的 score</span></p><p data-lake-id="u74c25f8f" id="u74c25f8f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u638c6f8a" id="u638c6f8a">生成建模的目标在于：利用给定数据集学习一个能够从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d6c4e1c5d9c24d87859de81ee160b17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DdrWl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3dea740a" id="u3dea740a">中生成新样本的模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud5a756e5" id="ud5a756e5">。基于 score 的生成建模框架主要由两个核心组成部分构成：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud14e63d6" id="ud14e63d6" style="color: #5C0036">score matching 与 Langevin dynamics</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u40bf6aad" id="u40bf6aad"><span data-lake-id="uf09f7411" id="uf09f7411">🪙</span><span data-lake-id="ue9401f3e" id="ue9401f3e"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub93e6351" id="ub93e6351">借助 score matching，不必先显式学习数据分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d6c4e1c5d9c24d87859de81ee160b17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mXUck%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4cd5adc" id="uc4cd5adc">，而是直接训练一个 score network </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdfdb023f904e93b9d4f3c133861da323.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x1cTp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf7bfa629" id="uf7bfa629">去估计</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ff9ca078dca783d97a1af706400b5ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sGbOE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufec872f1"><li fid="ue06b05ca" data-lake-id="u0b50299e" id="u0b50299e"><span data-lake-id="u03c10b34" id="u03c10b34" style="color: #000000">不同于 score matching 的典型用法，并不将某个能量模型的梯度作为 score network，以避免高阶梯度带来的额外计算开销</span></li><li fid="ue06b05ca" data-lake-id="uec383790" id="uec383790"><span data-lake-id="u7f41309f" id="u7f41309f" style="color: #000000">其目标函数是最小化：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%7D%5C%5CBig%5B%5C%5Cbig%5C%5C%7Cs_%5C%5Ctheta(x)-%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%5C%5Cbig%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5CBig%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa49a8be3c501dc344851fe0a4f19d46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dz85y%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u198f06d4" id="u198f06d4" style="color: #000000">。并且可以证明，该目标在忽略与参数无关的常数项后，等价于下面的形式</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%7D%5C%5CBig%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btr%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Cnabla_x%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%5C%5Cbig)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5C%7Cs_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5CBig%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e792461ce17dd5e13ddea0976d28a42.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RrZPF%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u933b2649" id="u933b2649" style="color: #000000">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_x%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5d38c5d266e7baf187e3d32ed3673d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OwKI4%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u7949597a" id="u7949597a" style="color: #000000">表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7db2a63601cfb186c42eca0f165f02c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fARqw%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u156f09f2" id="u156f09f2" style="color: #000000">关于输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6086b938a77367526d28191ee807f812.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tK7lx%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc6fe6c8" id="ucc6fe6c8" style="color: #000000">的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1ee85132" id="u1ee85132">Jacobian 矩阵</span></strong></li><li fid="ue06b05ca" data-lake-id="u3848afde" id="u3848afde"><span data-lake-id="u620640e1" id="u620640e1">在一定正则条件下，该目标的最优解满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta%5E*(x)%3D%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe8a46e16b7ba162b690d6cbd61756f4f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sRsEB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc88d89f" id="udc88d89f">。训练不需要显式的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88f80c5b0c68730841890c61db49a54c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vx9M5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a184bda" id="u8a184bda">，只需要能对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d55c58894df1f5539f1ad602b839b3e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R7BVS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua88a9642" id="ua88a9642">做自动微分</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue5697ec4" id="ue5697ec4"><span data-lake-id="ua9d22601" id="ua9d22601">🪙</span><span data-lake-id="u8c4d33b2" id="u8c4d33b2"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdde64c3" id="ucdde64c3">Denoising score matching 是 score matching 的一种变体</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u668da4a1" id="u668da4a1">，它能够完全避免计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btr%7D(%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f43d16e1085309095dc79f11134c7ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xDmZX%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3649c676"><li fid="u6ab234ee" data-lake-id="u0db141a1" id="u0db141a1"><span data-lake-id="u4fc23468" id="u4fc23468">首先利用一个预先给定的噪声分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b5977ef307db282265aca3b4b60a1cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CXGPM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c8be5ea" id="u5c8be5ea">对数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6086b938a77367526d28191ee807f812.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EBvdy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34935f4f" id="u34935f4f">进行扰动；对扰动后的数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D)%20%5C%5Ctriangleq%20%5C%5Cint%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb180d87a3d05653254294e5cf8f4add.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Utb9e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94ac5188" id="u94ac5188">应用 score matching，以估计该扰动分布的 score，其目标函数等价于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%5C%5C%2Cq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%20x%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%20%5C%5CBig%5B%5C%5Cbig%5C%5C%7Cs_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%20x)-%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%20x%7D%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%20x%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5C%5Cbig%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5CBig%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01e65c5f790f610f8ba3dfe7af817925.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ku91N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5631b30a" id="u5631b30a">，其最优解是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta%5E*(x)%3D%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa0399d0afcdd1f299af81d9889c58456.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AEAsO%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u6ab234ee" data-lake-id="u995588e6" id="u995588e6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub64f5923" id="ub64f5923" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">然而</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%5C%5Cast%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e95980fb50a06d4e6e9f10b9c19bb7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gzhlw%22%7D" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd628d2c" id="ufd628d2c" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">这一近似仅在噪声足够小时才成立，即只有当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Capprox%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6797634b5e87bff51c08da059dd8d621.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tMIcL%22%7D" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u33c40c07" id="u33c40c07" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">时，扰动分布的 score 才能够近似原始数据分布的 score</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u454ac2db" id="u454ac2db"><span data-lake-id="ud561ba60" id="ud561ba60">🪙</span><span data-lake-id="u04749224" id="u04749224"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3408183a" id="u3408183a">Sliced score matching</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0918c895" id="u0918c895"> 的核心思想，是用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ube7c23a0" id="ube7c23a0">随机投影</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua9c1a24a" id="ua9c1a24a">来近似原始 score matching 中难以计算的 Jacobian 迹项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btr%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76ec4e8eb9420dcf7e84e6d9e691f2be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ppxvB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u41942a24"><li fid="u47fc810d" data-lake-id="u2043291d" id="u2043291d"><span data-lake-id="u38c01e76" id="u38c01e76">其训练目标写为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20v%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20v%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20v%20%2B%5C%5Cfrac12%20%5C%5C%7Cs_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc16bf7d3acfc3e1200188ef694a5a56b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ps927%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uca5c4316" id="uca5c4316">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ec022a832d60c1000c4608ed773275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g1xlx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c5a2a0e" id="u9c5a2a0e">表示随机向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20v%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4fd87fc3730cd1fa0831ac2b6113491.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KuHtB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89b497fe" id="u89b497fe">的简单分布，例如多元标准高斯分布</span></li><li fid="u47fc810d" data-lake-id="uec0deb50" id="uec0deb50"><span data-lake-id="u93b57c72" id="u93b57c72">关键在于，原本难算的迹项被替换为随机方向上的二次型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20v%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F206e9cd7273c789ae2973532cecc65b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MUkpo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea3a258f" id="uea3a258f">，而这一项可以借助</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u601af069" id="u601af069">前向模式自动微分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf6aa1f52" id="uf6aa1f52">高效计算</span></li><li fid="u47fc810d" data-lake-id="u1bb2347e" id="u1bb2347e"><span data-lake-id="u94c44b6b" id="u94c44b6b">与去噪 score matching 旨在估计</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1545a435" id="u1545a435">扰动后数据分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc51719de" id="uc51719de">的 score 不同，sliced score matching 直接针对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ued4e45ab" id="ued4e45ab">原始未扰动数据分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc26dd757" id="uc26dd757">进行 score 估计；但由于其依赖前向模式自动微分，因此计算开销更高，约为前者的四倍</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1c46d04f" id="u1c46d04f"><span data-lake-id="u9aa19f26" id="u9aa19f26">🪙</span><span data-lake-id="u4ca7b739" id="u4ca7b739"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cdad8e8" id="u7cdad8e8" style="color: #5C0036">Langevin dynamics 能够仅依赖概率密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3393d06da157e5e68d41cb15a41ef893.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ko4fB%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2ea2c702" id="u2ea2c702" style="color: #5C0036">的 score 函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90db310a9943c11bb9224c672269ac0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22abR85%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3ed3096" id="ub3ed3096" style="color: #5C0036">来生成样本。给定固定步长</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b8e97bc6122834c0f710e8147c36603.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WbjU2%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u08a9d690" id="u08a9d690" style="color: #5C0036">，以及一个来自先验分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F60408b64cbf8d4c6ac349d1d462ca36a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0CNJ%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1fde0315" id="u1fde0315" style="color: #5C0036">的初始值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_0%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d0b19fb69679e09afa3c685876e3146.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hadjm%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2d49d81" id="ue2d49d81" style="color: #5C0036">，Langevin 方法按如下递推式进行更新：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4a17d24b" id="u4a17d24b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20x_t%3D%5C%5Ctilde%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Ctilde%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%5C%5C%2Cz_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20z_t%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2db36784108f8be431f5e2e29b5fe542.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FRQ3m%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u51dea2e8"><li fid="u1e77fb10" data-lake-id="u103f1768" id="u103f1768"><span data-lake-id="udf548da8" id="udf548da8">收敛性与校正：当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cto%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F708a7bc8b3eb9dbad0b28c57e58be84f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IPPuj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5cddfa41" id="u5cddfa41">且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9ed4b900e8468eedf7e3c2772c76f66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UKBCu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4283da5" id="ud4283da5">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F66834fa99c028b1b7bae471963f471dc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OT6xA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2689134a" id="u2689134a">的分布等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a43d844d20cf8c9a4edce9ccb6c442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Drroy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u674cafaa" id="u674cafaa">；若</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%CE%B5%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc15760472b4a75f4f80e043fa58b57cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ftNVt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89283ae8" id="u89283ae8">且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%3C%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff3f764568c4a51ea837ce484ebb8c94d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kqzmx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46f4e980" id="u46f4e980">，严格来说需要 Metropolis–Hastings 校正，但实践里常在小步长、大步数时忽略</span></li><li fid="u1e77fb10" data-lake-id="u7ec202fe" id="u7ec202fe"><span data-lake-id="ub7d3b08f" id="ub7d3b08f">为从真实数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d6c4e1c5d9c24d87859de81ee160b17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vDNHL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ceacd94" id="u2ceacd94">中生成样本，只需先训练一个 score network，使其满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1055a5ea2be490ddbdd4bcd5e1066ac0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ymShW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf4ac213a" id="uf4ac213a">，再用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdfdb023f904e93b9d4f3c133861da323.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WkdN5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaef78611" id="uaef78611">近似替代真实 score，配合 Langevin dynamics 进行采样即可</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="bapw6" id="bapw6" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u46d908ed" id="u46d908ed">🦥</span><span data-lake-id="u50e0968f" id="u50e0968f"> 𝐶ℎ𝑎𝑙𝑙𝑒𝑛𝑔𝑒𝑠 𝑂𝑓 𝑆𝑐𝑜𝑟𝑒-𝐵𝑎𝑠𝑒𝑑 𝐺𝑒𝑛𝑒𝑟𝑎𝑡𝑖𝑣𝑒 𝑀𝑜𝑑𝑒𝑙𝑖𝑛𝑔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u9f18ca57" id="u9f18ca57"><strong><span data-lake-id="udb399f68" id="udb399f68" style="color: #270070">数据分布的 score 是在环境空间中对对数密度求梯度，但如果数据只支撑在低维流形上，那么这个梯度在环境空间里往往不再良定义。原始的 score matching 目标只有在数据分布支撑覆盖整个空间时才能给出一致的 score 估计，而当数据分布仅位于低维流形上时，估计会变得不一致</span></strong></p><ul list="u94fc1b8a"><li fid="u8100d5e7" data-lake-id="ue3dd6f81" id="ue3dd6f81"><span data-lake-id="u7e58e68e" id="u7e58e68e">左图表示在原始 CIFAR-10 图像上直接训练时，sliced score matching 的损失虽然起初下降，但随后出现明显的不规则波动，训练过程难以稳定收敛。右图则表示在对数据施加小幅高斯噪声扰动后，由于扰动分布在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa7d050732469c611fd7aace8ced5934e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ymo1f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubcb4d76f" id="ubcb4d76f">上具有全支撑，损失曲线能够逐步收敛，训练稳定性显著改善</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue2114eec" id="ue2114eec" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774192148614-3b2b5524-90f1-42fe-95df-3c316a626ee0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucc8fedd8-f9ff-47d6-bbb3-db5ebba965f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u62ba2f3d-b5db-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A510.81817626953125%2C%22height%22%3A192%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A143269%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1108%2C%22originHeight%22%3A416%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%221QK20K30K%22%2C%22x%22%3A220%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A203%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OK2OK3OK%22%2C%22x%22%3A758%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A207%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFLTERATIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A273%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%23OFLTERATIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A801%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K4OK5OK%22%2C%22x%22%3A916%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A116%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OK4OK5OK%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A180%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-2E%2B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A213%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227.2E%2B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A587%2C%22y%22%3A283%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221E%2B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223E%2B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A67%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226.8E%2B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A584%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226.4%2B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A578%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226.6E%E5%8D%816%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A106%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227E%E5%8D%816%22%2C%22x%22%3A599%2C%22y%22%3A224%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221OK%22%2C%22x%22%3A750%2C%22y%22%3A331%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf5f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6a03729c%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u581f64e4" id="u581f64e4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2b76761" id="ud2b76761" style="color: #2A4200">低密度区域中的数据稀缺，会同时破坏 score 估计与 Langevin dynamics 采样，因此即使 score-based generative modeling 在高密度区域内表现良好，也难以直接在全局上恢复真实数据分布</span></strong></p><ul list="u2cee51dc"><li fid="u5a963fc0" data-lake-id="u66c3609f" id="u66c3609f"><span data-lake-id="u07625356" id="u07625356">在 score matching 的训练中，期望是由有限样本近似的；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u217f53eb" id="u217f53eb">当某一区域的数据概率极低时，训练样本几乎不会覆盖这些位置，于是网络缺乏足够监督信号去准确学习该区域的 score，导致 score 估计只在数据模态附近较为可靠，而在低密度区域明显失真</span></strong></li><li fid="u5a963fc0" data-lake-id="u5d3338ec" id="u5d3338ec"><span data-lake-id="u0724be66" id="u0724be66">左图是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u969ca1c9" id="u969ca1c9">真实数据分布的 score 场</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3549b1e0" id="u3549b1e0">，右图是用 score matching 学出来的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub857d956" id="ub857d956">估计 score 场</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u278e50bd" id="u278e50bd">。背景的橙色深浅表示数据密度，颜色越深说明该区域样本越多、概率越高；箭头表示在各个位置上 score 向量场的方向与大小 </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4a48d8df" id="u4a48d8df" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774232088630-8c704ca5-ecbc-4829-8800-0500caa623ec.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u061f3cb1-3773-46e8-bab0-0b91f701565%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3f7622b5-32fe-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A428.8%2C%22height%22%3A218%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A153986%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A536%2C%22originHeight%22%3A272%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ESTIMATEDSCORES%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATASCORES%22%2C%22x%22%3A92%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efdcce%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u841ca638%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2ee04b4d"><li fid="u731ea041" data-lake-id="u27bb11f7" id="u27bb11f7"><span data-lake-id="u012e3a99" id="u012e3a99">Langevin dynamics 的采样依赖 score 引导样本在空间中移动；当不同数据模态之间被低密度区域隔开时，采样过程虽然理论上仍可能收敛到目标分布，但实际往往需要极小步长和大量迭代才能完成有效混合，否则就难以正确恢复不同模态之间的相对权重，甚至无法在可接受时间内逼近真实分布</span></li><li fid="u731ea041" data-lake-id="u7ebf636d" id="u7ebf636d"><span data-lake-id="ua6c8e4e5" id="ua6c8e4e5">即使使用真实 score，普通 Langevin dynamics 在多模态分布上的采样仍可能无法正确恢复各模态的相对权重，而 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68a7c307" id="u68a7c307" style="color: #004347">annealed Langevin dynamics</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc086c530" id="uc086c530"> 能显著改善这一问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6aaba5a8" id="u6aaba5a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774232266224-d632c762-c449-44dc-b758-def17bd39ddf.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7daaef5e-74b8-4826-b1ea-a83d1664c05%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3f7622b5-32fe-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A614.7999877929688%2C%22height%22%3A239%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A111274%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A976%2C%22originHeight%22%3A380%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANNEALEDLANGEVINDYNAMICSSAMPLES%22%2C%22x%22%3A680%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A291%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I.I.DSAMPLES%22%2C%22x%22%3A128%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NAMICSSAMPLES%22%2C%22x%22%3A481%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A247%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LANGEVINDY%22%2C%22x%22%3A395%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A113%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A352%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)%22%2C%22x%22%3A811%2C%22y%22%3A352%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22x%22%3A487%2C%22y%22%3A352%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CSSAMPLES%22%2C%22x%22%3A882%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A656%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A11%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4ca163f7%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="O5SVp" id="O5SVp" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue6e13ecb" id="ue6e13ecb">🪺</span><span data-lake-id="u2b0501aa" id="u2b0501aa"> 𝑵𝒐𝒊𝒔𝒆 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒅𝒊𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒂𝒍 𝑺𝒄𝒐𝒓𝒆 𝑵𝒆𝒕𝒘𝒐𝒓𝒌𝒔: 𝑳𝒆𝒂𝒓𝒏𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑨𝒏𝒅 𝑰𝒏𝒇𝒆𝒓𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒆</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua3dd95c9" id="ua3dd95c9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u227e1a1a" id="u227e1a1a">对数据加入高斯噪声可以同时缓解困难</span></strong></p><ul list="u6a6849e4"><li fid="u8b421562" data-lake-id="u0223b436" id="u0223b436"><span data-lake-id="ud500cad4" id="ud500cad4">一方面，噪声使扰动分布获得全空间支撑，从而绕开低维流形导致的 score 不适定问题；另一方面，较大的噪声会填补原始分布中的低密度区域，为 score matching 提供更充分的训练信号</span></li><li fid="u8b421562" data-lake-id="u25bea5dc" id="u25bea5dc"><span data-lake-id="u122bd561" id="u122bd561">进一步地，若使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68547455" id="u68547455">多个噪声层级</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8a8b5526" id="u8a8b5526">，就能够得到一串从平滑分布逐步过渡到真实数据分布的中间分布，这不仅有助于学习不同噪声水平下的 score，也能够在采样阶段通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua04ec7dc" id="ua04ec7dc">从大噪声到小噪声的退火式 Langevin dynamics </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u158e17ca" id="u158e17ca">改善多模态分布上的混合能力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc2c897f9" id="uc2c897f9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u357246a1" id="u357246a1">通过以下两个方面改进基于 score 的生成建模</span></strong></p><ul list="uc08ae74b"><li fid="u87765bf2" data-lake-id="u9223a70b" id="u9223a70b"><span data-lake-id="ue834d8ec" id="ue834d8ec">其一，利用不同强度的噪声对数据进行扰动；其二，通过训练一个单一的条件 score 网络，同时估计所有噪声水平对应的 score</span></li><li fid="u87765bf2" data-lake-id="u1bcaac5e" id="u1bcaac5e"><span data-lake-id="u02630a1c" id="u02630a1c">训练完成后，在利用 Langevin dynamics 生成样本时，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1649a6dc" id="u1649a6dc" style="color: #00346B">首先采用对应于较大噪声水平的 score，并随着采样推进逐步降低噪声水平</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u57db28ea" id="u57db28ea">。这样可以将大噪声层级所带来的全局探索优势，平滑地传递到低噪声层级，而在低噪声层级下，扰动数据已经与原始数据几乎难以区分</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udc98d5a5" id="udc98d5a5"><span data-lake-id="u3a32a502" id="u3a32a502">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ue3df9e26" id="ue3df9e26"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc412bb31" id="uc412bb31" style="color: #E746A4">噪声条件 score network 怎么定义</span></strong></p><ul list="ud0295abf"><li fid="u5cd015b6" data-lake-id="u819d7f2c" id="u819d7f2c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub58120b4" id="ub58120b4">首先构造一组按几何级数递减的正噪声标准差</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EL%2C%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_1%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_2%7D%3D%5C%5Ccdots%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7BL-1%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_L%7D%3E1.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2fa9735cb8ac6e483b97c1cac3b08c1e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hQw68%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97fdbc95" id="u97fdbc95">对于每一个噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff776541cc2d3c0085d4f7a96bc6c872f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yc8pN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u43425558" id="u43425558">，定义相应的扰动数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(x)%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(t)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x%5C%5Cmid%20t%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20I)%5C%5C%2Cdt.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a3b1d0d492bea30fb37ce7cb66e6a69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hwNEu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0205d28" id="ue0205d28">最大噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F688190253b029a37a8f89940b9f408c9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JDDtW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1356eabf" id="u1356eabf">要足够大，以缓解流形假设和低密度区域问题；最小噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3bc2fecdb428eb9704ec87efaeead46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iWpdP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1edec0e3" id="u1edec0e3">要足够小，以保证扰动分布仍然尽可能接近原始数据分布</span></li><li fid="u5cd015b6" data-lake-id="uf1cbbded" id="uf1cbbded"><span data-lake-id="u0b48fb40" id="u0b48fb40">在此基础上，作者提出训练一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f3415b2" id="u7f3415b2">条件 score 网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b1178802232ac8a6995d87f27feeb69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IfieG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf258a1d1" id="uf258a1d1">，使其在每个噪声水平下都满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9645abe4deb492bdfec843d844c0b6dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f2o6P%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u86c9ca9c" id="u86c9ca9c">，网络学习的不是单一分布的 score，而是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c9d8afe" id="u8c9d8afe">所有扰动分布的 score 的统一近似</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue3a3881b" id="ue3a3881b">。因为网络以噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22weO1N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb272d2f" id="ubb272d2f">作为条件输入，所以作者将其称为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u15ae7bac" id="u15ae7bac">Noise Conditional Score Network</span></strong></li><li fid="u5cd015b6" data-lake-id="ue816500f" id="ue816500f"><span data-lake-id="u6d513020" id="u6d513020">由于该网络的输出与输入图像同形状，本质上属于密集预测问题，因此在图像任务中采用 U-Net、空洞卷积、instance normalization 以及条件归一化等结构设计，以提升多尺度 score 估计的能力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u60444f90" id="u60444f90"><span data-lake-id="u85c126dc" id="u85c126dc">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u5e3888a9" id="u5e3888a9"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua74840a5" id="ua74840a5" style="color: #E746A4">把 NCSN 的训练正式写成多噪声层级下的去噪 score matching 联合优化问题，并通过</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma)%3D%5C%5Csigma%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1366cd912b2c411620c91b2c6b45bf02.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22anjpO%22%7D" style="color: #E746A4"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0ac6cde" id="uf0ac6cde" style="color: #E746A4">实现不同噪声水平之间的平衡训练</span></strong></p><ul list="u8c0e1efb"><li fid="u05e76925" data-lake-id="u8f951a11" id="u8f951a11"><span data-lake-id="ufd03d440" id="ufd03d440">首先，作者指出 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u66c8d0f8" id="u66c8d0f8">sliced score matching 和 denoising score matching 都可以训练 NCSN</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue9647918" id="ue9647918">，但最终选择 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u864012e0" id="u864012e0">DSM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uea110cfe" id="uea110cfe">，因为它计算更快，而且更自然地对应学习噪声扰动分布的 score 这一任务</span></li><li fid="u05e76925" data-lake-id="u825c94df" id="u825c94df"><span data-lake-id="ua61ba041" id="ua61ba041">具体地，作者取高斯扰动分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20I)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F288b60a0c446ca160790b1238fca332f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ATw7B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub4abe628" id="ub4abe628">因此其条件 score 可以直接写成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D-x%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma%5E2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54e19312ff2b9f660feb40654364cd01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xcS92%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46e48a2a" id="u46e48a2a">在此基础上，对任一固定噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Llrxc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8bce023b" id="u8bce023b">，得到对应的 DSM 训练目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell(%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5Csigma)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac12%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20I)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D-x%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb02e12ff66b6b2bf6e882119813747bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cJVb2%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u05e76925" data-lake-id="u39839d42" id="u39839d42"><span data-lake-id="uf1cee56c" id="uf1cee56c">其次，作者将所有噪声层级上的损失统一起来，构造出整体训练目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L(%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EL)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac1L%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EL%20%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma_i)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cell(%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5Csigma_i).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3800b37b71813e9298a53e975799b1b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JByus%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ea35303" id="u0ea35303">用一个共享参数的条件网络，同时学习所有噪声水平下扰动分布的 score</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucce6b086" id="ucce6b086">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u92542fc6" id="u92542fc6" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">并且在网络容量足够的条件下，整体目标最优当且仅当网络在每个</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc302e028f05f811e7586b967f6dfa479.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rgm2m%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u56df81dc" id="u56df81dc" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">上都满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta%5E*(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%3D%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(x).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67f8c8b623f6dea92a817be4f54c5024.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PXkbE%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card></li><li fid="u05e76925" data-lake-id="u67446f95" id="u67446f95"><span data-lake-id="ucc9f9455" id="ucc9f9455">不同噪声层级对应的损失项在量级上大致平衡，而不是让某些噪声段主导训练。经验上，当网络接近最优时，score 的范数大致满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Cs_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma)%5C%5C%7C_2%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac1%5C%5Csigma.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea17c7928b0c2e401ca93a511410725e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KxsoF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueb6ff4e1" id="ueb6ff4e1">因此作者取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma)%3D%5C%5Csigma%5E2%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F60a5458bcf416b46c83b89bb0f19ecac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qXtFG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueefa795e" id="ueefa795e">这样可以使不同噪声水平上的加权损失保持相近量级，从而改善联合训练的稳定性与均衡性</span></li><li fid="u05e76925" data-lake-id="u0601b5ab" id="u0601b5ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="u55e85bb3" id="u55e85bb3">不需要对抗训练，不需要 surrogate likelihood，也不需要在训练阶段从模型中采样</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5f1819b2" id="u5f1819b2">；同时，对网络结构本身也没有额外的可归一化约束</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3b356718" id="u3b356718"><span data-lake-id="u1a884f25" id="u1a884f25"> </span><span data-lake-id="u1119e434" id="u1119e434">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u2972c3f3" id="u2972c3f3"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uda3e4474" id="uda3e4474" style="color: #E746A4">NCSN 在训练完成后如何进行采样生成，其核心方法是 annealed Langevin dynamics</span></strong></p><ul list="u1384210c"><li fid="ude543678" data-lake-id="ube4e9cf1" id="ube4e9cf1"><span data-lake-id="u0a6feec5" id="u0a6feec5">具体而言，给定训练好的条件 score 网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd2b8d49630324fd0ae6217ebebe6d8c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vSW7Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f57cb82" id="u6f57cb82">采样从先验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20x_0%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe69c36251b0bbe8d3d64dec7035b97ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qf4TS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf0eb954" id="ubf0eb954">出发，在每个噪声层级</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc302e028f05f811e7586b967f6dfa479.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cCOUp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u147b3b14" id="u147b3b14">上迭代</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20x_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctilde%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D%7B2%7Ds_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7Dz_t%2C%20z_t%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2CI)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1f5fd8249d4d365af7c54a7872948e90.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wZNpT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7ad81a7" id="uc7ad81a7">并令步长满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_i%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_L%5E2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc46ac4d54ea6ab732cb5aee609a894c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WPeUM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5697b3a5" id="u5697b3a5">这样，大噪声阶段负责在平滑分布上进行全局探索与跨模态混合，小噪声阶段负责逐步细化并逼近真实数据分布，从而比普通 Langevin dynamics 更有效地恢复多模态分布的结构与相对权重</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uffa31900" id="uffa31900" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774236677028-76824f83-7b5a-4b0b-a0b1-1a5885d29e6b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u342058c7-c48a-41a2-8b8d-a10b38b4be2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0a88e1ab-5ab3-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A505.6%2C%22height%22%3A312%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A50918%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A632%2C%22originHeight%22%3A390%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%87%E4%BB%81%E6%96%871-1%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%8080(8T-1%2C0)%E5%8D%81%2F04%22%2C%22x%22%3A149%2C%22y%22%3A209%2C%22width%22%3A460%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAWZT~W(O%2CL)%22%2C%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A248%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%3AFORI%E4%B8%801TOLDO%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A254%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PAIISTHESTEPSIZE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A371%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A249%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220I%2CE%2C%E4%B8%8A.%22%2C%22x%22%3A130%2C%22y%22%3A10%2C%22width%22%3A176%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORT%E4%B8%801TODO%22%2C%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A225%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AI-E.0.%2F0%22%2C%22x%22%3A98%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%3ALNITIALIZEXO%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A189%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A220%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%870%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E4%B8%AA%22%2C%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNXR%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REGUIRE%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A9%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3AENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A108%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f3f3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u001bd932%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4bb14077"><li fid="u7807c34a" data-lake-id="u7c3fd815" id="u7c3fd815"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud09f303e" id="ud09f303e">步长与噪声方差成正比</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5458bfbd" id="u5458bfbd">。动机是让不同噪声层级下 Langevin 更新中的信号—噪声比使 Langevin 动力学中信噪比</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D%5C%5C%2Cz%7D2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc045113ef7f156ec0835756890c9e0c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rN9Ad%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e2d8f55" id="u9e2d8f55">的量级保持稳定。注意到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D%7Dz%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%5C%5C%7Cs_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%7D%7B4%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Csigma_i%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6060818236321f7fa7fe805cabf31c02.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O5X0u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf1ce606" id="udf1ce606">当 score 网络训练得接近最优时</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Cs_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma)%5C%5C%7C_2%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0fe51d2e40c6f40e09fd347dfa6d28b1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GM69A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u901ae6d5" id="u901ae6d5">在这种情况下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Csigma_i%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma_i)%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cpropto%201.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa227d74c7ab80d20e44c45ef34c020ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CtXCV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5057755a" id="u5057755a">因而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D%7Dz%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Csigma_i%20s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma_i)%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffeec04d9060d97bed4159d8c3bd04e6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JFR3B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6a8b42a2" id="u6a8b42a2">，即该量不依赖于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Csigma_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb9c4c2bff05d4b7aa025b9ff247975be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BdJFS%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9f3d6228" id="u9f3d6228"><span data-lake-id="u828be94c" id="u828be94c">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uc705fa61" id="uc705fa61"> 刻画平滑后扰动分布的 score 学习目标，首先考虑显式地匹配非参数估计分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdefa1918735564a669f99995026033e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ovijG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud95e8f51" id="ud95e8f51">的 score，得到显式 score matching 目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BESM%7Dq_%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70763d99f2aff20058fa9811e24a3061.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J8pV1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0e2494a" id="uc0e2494a">。进一步地，在引入干净样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cumTi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74d260cf" id="u74d260cf">与扰动样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc2bf1065ebf9b44c2008128aa53e88e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YNkbK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac5f0c21" id="uac5f0c21">的联合分布后，可以构造</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u276197e5" id="u276197e5">去噪 score matching 目标</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDSM%7Dq_%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf1eac3794d065c1bb77dbec622880b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lU0xm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4ec80b23" id="u4ec80b23">，其核心思想是利用条件扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81e7b3bbed18e148248b94f30edde848.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22heseN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u38a68907" id="u38a68907">的 score 作为可计算的监督信号。尽管二者的形式不同，但在理论上二者是等价的，即对模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bu2Os%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7db8300c" id="u7db8300c">的优化具有相同的效果</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5a908ca3" id="u5a908ca3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BESM%7Dq_%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cpsi(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%2Cx)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cpsi(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%7Cx)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%3DJ_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDSM%7Dq_%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F783726869a40a33e5366c1d977bec722.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Krn9X%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u05b96fda"><li fid="udbb74405" data-lake-id="u1c9d933a" id="u1c9d933a"><span data-lake-id="uf9ed890c" id="uf9ed890c">采样阶段所使用的 score 实际上是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbedee03c283eed109cc2d6a20920880a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LUy9d%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc5864317" id="uc5864317">的 score，而非原始数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a863029b81b90e56270582c8e6b9f31.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22exqyR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2926b231" id="u2926b231">的 score。虽然训练时采用条件扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%20x%5C%5Cmid%20x)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f6687cd424b617e00f6daa1d1f9e41b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WHoHV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub6f58d54" id="ub6f58d54">的 score 作为监督信号，但依据 denoising score matching 理论，网络最优时所逼近的是边缘分布 score：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(x).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e3a183cef49e10701eb8623dc7e82f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DvvTt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue46a1009" id="ue46a1009">仅当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc302e028f05f811e7586b967f6dfa479.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HWQg6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0027aa0" id="ue0027aa0">足够小时，由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(x)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F895908e6b3b3e2ef8dfa0a6dc9b1fa1c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eHVN2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9ecc5c5" id="ub9ecc5c5">逐渐接近</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe387ba908dfc7b7803307eae14190c1c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qqL9k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa5ab8de" id="ufa5ab8de">，才有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(x)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ec87f01cc469b2279b16763f41fff9e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MM34I%22%7D"></card></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="yfKpI" id="yfKpI" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u58231d38" id="u58231d38">🕊️</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6f3e808" id="ub6f3e808"> 𝐃𝐞𝐧𝐨𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐛𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u3ea582db" id="u3ea582db"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22cd0f67" id="u22cd0f67" style="color: #70000D">扩散概率模型定义</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u569a22b6" id="u569a22b6">：一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d7dadc0" id="u8d7dadc0">经过参数化的马尔可夫链</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u89876ebc" id="u89876ebc">，通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua684a83d" id="ua684a83d">变分推断</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u642a1378" id="u642a1378">进行训练，使其在有限步采样后生成与真实数据分布一致的样本。该模型包含两个方向相反的过程</span></p><ul list="u557353c5"><li fid="u6886f7a8" data-lake-id="ud4f344c6" id="ud4f344c6"><span data-lake-id="u3bf2c0f0" id="u3bf2c0f0">其一是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5a52c58" id="uc5a52c58">前向扩散过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u973634e9" id="u973634e9">，即一个固定的马尔可夫链，按照给定方差调度逐步向数据中加入高斯噪声，直到原始信号基本被破坏</span></li><li fid="u6886f7a8" data-lake-id="u6f6bb0e0" id="u6f6bb0e0"><span data-lake-id="u547f50c2" id="u547f50c2">其二是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uff78dfa6" id="uff78dfa6">反向生成过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf3a6ca92" id="uf3a6ca92">，即学习一个从纯噪声逐步恢复样本的马尔可夫链，用来逆转前向加噪过程</span></li><li fid="u6886f7a8" data-lake-id="u20df1282" id="u20df1282"><span data-lake-id="uc55b3f18" id="uc55b3f18">当每一步扩散只加入较小的高斯噪声时，反向过程的转移也可以设为条件高斯分布，因此能够采用非常简洁的神经网络参数化形式。训练时，模型优化负对数似然的变分下界。而在特定的噪声预测参数化下，这一目标又可写成与多噪声层级 denoising score matching 相似的形式，并使采样过程呈现出 annealed Langevin dynamics 的解释</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubca46574" id="ubca46574"><strong><span data-lake-id="u935b6bfb" id="u935b6bfb" style="color: #70000D">贡献概括：</span></strong></p><ol list="uf04615ed"><li fid="uee8f34c0" data-lake-id="u6bfac2aa" id="u6bfac2aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a5a86bc" id="u1a5a86bc">高质量生成能力验证</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9565d82b" id="u9565d82b">：论文证明扩散模型能够生成与 GAN、自回归模型、流模型及 EBM 等主流方法相竞争的高质量样本，并在 CIFAR-10 上取得 9.46 的 IS 和 3.17 的 FID，确立扩散模型作为强生成范式的地位</span></li><li fid="uee8f34c0" data-lake-id="u16cb9398" id="u16cb9398"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8c7d05c" id="ua8c7d05c">扩散与 DSM/Langevin 的统一联系</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc61646b7" id="uc61646b7">：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4824f0b0" id="u4824f0b0" style="color: #00346B">论文建立扩散模型与 denoising score matching、annealed Langevin dynamics 之间的明确桥梁</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11ea7f61" id="u11ea7f61">，并提出基于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3d3af9d" id="ua3d3af9d">噪声预测</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u22a288a2" id="u22a288a2">与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u407a4c44" id="u407a4c44">加权变分下界</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue339dfad" id="ue339dfad">的实用训练方式</span></li><li fid="uee8f34c0" data-lake-id="u442850a5" id="u442850a5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf8a6101a" id="uf8a6101a">渐进式生成/压缩解释</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua5d59558" id="ua5d59558">：论文提出扩散采样可以理解为一种由粗到细的渐进式解码过程，即先恢复全局结构，再补充局部细节；从压缩角度看，这相当于一种有损到无损的渐进编码，也可被视为对自回归解码的广义推广，从而解释样本观感强但似然不占优的现象</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="uad3115a7" id="uad3115a7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1759502099474-87b0fc85-8d45-4754-9743-4577ec506d1b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucda60dcf-f828-4ee8-9f8d-aff1610c581%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub19bc007-ebee-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A841.102294921875%2C%22height%22%3A150%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A64750%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1025%2C%22originHeight%22%3A183%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22P0(XT-1XT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224XTXT-1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A414%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XT%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XT%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A560%2C%22y%22%3A64%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%E4%B8%8A%22%2C%22x%22%3A338%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A869%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f1f1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PxQMI%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="mS8z5" id="mS8z5" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub85a6f2b" id="ub85a6f2b">🐦</span><span data-lake-id="u81552b83" id="u81552b83"> 𝑩𝒂𝒄𝒌𝒈𝒓𝒐𝒖𝒏𝒅</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u19c78a7f" id="u19c78a7f"><span data-lake-id="ub2b1c28c" id="ub2b1c28c">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u64846b5f" id="u64846b5f"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uef1b8af8" id="uef1b8af8">扩散模型本质上是一类潜变量生成模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u65347e82" id="u65347e82">，其概率形式表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%3A%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%5C%5C%2Cdx_%7B1%3AT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d8f009cb0e18ae3f02345f5366c4f79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eprQq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u604069ad" id="u604069ad">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a1c7149f6cd4b9eaedbe45f54f7cdb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UlSpg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50e8fadf" id="u50e8fadf">表示与观测数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8ec1fd51c7226588dc1c1d241da70d9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zQdpL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50f6471d" id="u50f6471d">维度相同的一系列潜变量。模型的联合分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a4ae4146b74f50892bdc631811ecd06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bbF8c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74237b9f" id="u74237b9f">通常称为反向生成过程，其被建模为一个带有可学习高斯转移核的马尔可夫链，并从各向同性高斯先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x_T)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_T%3B0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1faf60d69346b027402c8cf9e30761db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XoChq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58d78160" id="u58d78160">开始，逐步恢复出目标数据样本</span></p><p data-lake-id="u85c089d9" id="u85c089d9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20%3A%3D%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5CSigma%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F879d808c0fbdde6c6b328b0535274909.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hITUQ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u16e62f06" id="u16e62f06"><span data-lake-id="u685cb90e" id="u685cb90e">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u3035821a" id="u3035821a"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubd74b511" id="ubd74b511">扩散模型区别于其他潜变量模型的关键在于，其近似后验分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F728ff608f91e0d6f3ee4cede450684a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kfpEe%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b6b407e" id="u2b6b407e">是预先固定的</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u71a1694b" id="u71a1694b">；该分布被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb5044ec" id="ubb5044ec">前向过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u284938f7" id="u284938f7">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc76b6ade" id="uc76b6ade">扩散过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u06da6455" id="u06da6455">。具体而言，它被设定为一个马尔可夫链，并按照给定的方差调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cbeta_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43d9eba227e8a41f4f59bc3140e2b2fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wAGL8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad7c1242" id="uad7c1242">，逐步向原始数据中加入高斯噪声：  </span></p><p data-lake-id="ue5ec11ac" id="ue5ec11ac" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38fc2d414a36d9dc2df34f11fae9d5b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PHEkO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uceb9d33a" id="uceb9d33a"><span data-lake-id="u220708ef" id="u220708ef">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u45e4df0c" id="u45e4df0c"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb9cfa69" id="ucb9cfa69" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">模型训练通过优化关于负对数似然的标准变分上界来进行，即把直接最小化负对数似然，换成最小化它的一个可计算上界</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0f747b17" id="u0f747b17">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u42ed0bd0" id="u42ed0bd0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cleq%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%5C%5Cgeq%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%3D%3A%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85ad80b094ecd8c69ed7ded1f5ba587b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aXBLX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufda810c0" id="ufda810c0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign%7D%5CnL%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%5C%5Cgeq%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5BD_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5C%7C%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T))%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E1%7D%20D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5C%7C%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t))%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F96c561b5b04c09b1bc27067fc748ef79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IkrJt%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub6a9714d" id="ub6a9714d"><span data-lake-id="u23db5f74" id="u23db5f74">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ucdcb0d92" id="ucdcb0d92"> 前向过程中的方差参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbba9de783a68cad893bf621ff351d81.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tbCrG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufdc360ef" id="ufdc360ef">可以通过重参数化方法进行学习，也可以作为超参数保持固定。反向过程的表达能力在一定程度上由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d595f009005a817ba0431fe917bcfeb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g5GnX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a238b64" id="u3a238b64">中采用高斯条件分布这一选择所保证，因为当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H7QQ5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua25ba0f8" id="ua25ba0f8">足够小时，前向过程与反向过程具有相同的函数形式。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u390fe60e" id="u390fe60e" style="color: #00346B">前向过程的一个显著性质在于，它允许在任意时间步</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eqgVD%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uec987e1f" id="uec987e1f" style="color: #00346B">以闭式形式对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa21cf1a7c05261064879de9d8c2557bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H6D6J%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u69483b89" id="u69483b89" style="color: #00346B">进行采样</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2bcc5f50" id="u2bcc5f50" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%20%3A%3D%201%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bs%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%20%5C%5Calpha_s.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a17a006144f16fbc3afa34a04aa3b91.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YKcbm%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8dede72e" id="u8dede72e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5Cn%5C%5Cboxed%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20%7C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f1f0557d53d0de88549eec5951d9e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PMMBh%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u557539e9" id="u557539e9"><span data-lake-id="ue64743be" id="ue64743be">5️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="udd3df095" id="udd3df095"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u93f8f6ac" id="u93f8f6ac" style="color: #101E60">前向后验具有闭式高斯形式，所有 KL 散度项都变成高斯分布之间的比较</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue06245fd" id="ue06245fd">，从而可以采用 Rao-Blackwellized 的方式，通过闭式表达式直接计算，而无需使用高方差的 Monte Carlo 估计</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue0a0302f" id="ue0a0302f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5Cparallel%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T))%7D_%7BL_T%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E1%7D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5Cparallel%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t))%7D_%7BL_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%7D_%7BL_0%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F948737d06e668ad68e50794d63457be9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JLK29%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udd9f0248" id="udd9f0248" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa04cdfce7e5a54e327647c39c138826.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w1mKN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u77b51f1d" id="u77b51f1d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd787716bcdb5924553cc328d08b905f9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M5A6U%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5615ad7e" id="u5615ad7e"><span data-lake-id="u0bad8f94" id="u0bad8f94">6️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u910e597a" id="u910e597a"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbe4c2e7" id="ufbe4c2e7">前向后验</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb55cddbbfa738c89e3b14c3c62eed1a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vVrP2%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ef877d0" id="u9ef877d0">的闭式表达式推导</span></strong></p><ol list="u9687a9bc"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="uca1109b7" id="uca1109b7"><span data-lake-id="u32d54d77" id="u32d54d77">由前向过程的闭式形式可知：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u0416afef" id="u0416afef" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20I).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6ea54b0cda513921f01e4543b74672f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QEJRJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u83701ac3" id="u83701ac3"> </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)I).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f24de68c6ae0679b2a8a2a825989991.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nzp2N%22%7D"></card></p><ol list="u9687a9bc" start="2"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="ud0225b47" id="ud0225b47"><span data-lake-id="uc682cb19" id="uc682cb19">由 Bayes 公式写出后验：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u6c9c6688" id="u6c9c6688" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20x_0)%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe34846e350187f1300c7f517bf6e0bcc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DhkTf%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u88a660d2" id="u88a660d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20q(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6abf3e5d76d1ec8e059127ef4576dc74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eeLBT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u407d4788" id="u407d4788" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft(%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20x_0%20%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24e98c29893c1b6496f4c7be1d7abe7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PkJmG%22%7D"></card></p><ol list="u9687a9bc" start="3"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="u6a69527d" id="u6a69527d"><span data-lake-id="u68769910" id="u68769910">忽略与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d8baf6861f4df36eba52b385984c38c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UoW3G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua913a206" id="ua913a206">无关的常数项</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u08713b14" id="u08713b14" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%7Cx_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20-%202%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20x_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20x_0%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85d48a7c12e3bc2264baaee49fbb0f2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SchtT%22%7D"></card></p><ol list="u9687a9bc" start="4"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="u19afafea" id="u19afafea"><span data-lake-id="u0d296361" id="u0d296361">高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x%3B%5C%5Cmu%2C%5C%5CSigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8db785328a528fee3eb1eeeae2724d04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B1w43%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f2a6a51" id="u0f2a6a51">的指数项标准形式是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cfrac12%5C%5Cleft%5Bx%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5CSigma%5E%7B-1%7Dx-2(%5C%5CSigma%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmu)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20x%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef64bf41a022cc3b2d276d5a62ca3640.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fh6p6%22%7D"></card></li></ol><p data-lake-id="uc19dd9a7" id="uc19dd9a7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20I%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CSigma_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20I%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47b00261160e2a1750043cdec8e8ed91.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N8BJv%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u30930b29" id="u30930b29" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20x_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20x_0%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51f63bc6341e499e1240b29796a884d3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zs74Q%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="vNGNf" id="vNGNf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uaa0ff5f8" id="uaa0ff5f8">🦣</span><span data-lake-id="uae06d8ba" id="uae06d8ba"> 𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝒅𝒆𝒏𝒐𝒊𝒔𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒂𝒖𝒕𝒐𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒓𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u1c082014" id="u1c082014"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ef4a602" id="u9ef4a602">将扩散模型的训练目标写为负对数似然的变分下界，并进一步分解为若干时间步上的 KL 散度项</span></strong></p><ul list="uf31fc824"><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="ub023576f" id="ub023576f"><span data-lake-id="u2991f1d3" id="u2991f1d3">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6bad1212292211d80f2f649c77d46187.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bllac%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2663ae68" id="u2663ae68">的中间各步，由于前向后验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb55cddbbfa738c89e3b14c3c62eed1a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QpFFF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c5e0691" id="u4c5e0691">具有闭式高斯形式，相应的 KL 项都可以转化为反向过程均值之间的加权平方误差</span></li><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="ub406619f" id="ub406619f"><span data-lake-id="u6a5eaa84" id="u6a5eaa84">结合前向过程的重参数化表示，模型训练又可等价改写为：在给定带噪样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mYZJB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1b3eca5" id="ua1b3eca5">和时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xlxpt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42d9c606" id="u42d9c606">的条件下，直接预测其中所包含的噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe93300e74073835ec6a8ca7353419eb3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pq2G6%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="uc430c33b" id="uc430c33b"><span data-lake-id="u913a3d4b" id="u913a3d4b">对最后一步的离散像素解码</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0b761c25a3ea6d46ab6ff4cb65bda844.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TtK2j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c189e82" id="u2c189e82">进行专门处理，以保证模型能够对离散图像数据给出合理的概率建模</span></li><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="uc7a06813" id="uc7a06813"><span data-lake-id="u5adfdd15" id="u5adfdd15">从完整的变分目标出发，进一步提出实践中更常用的简化训练目标，即随机采样时间步并最小化真实噪声与预测噪声之间的均方误差，从而得到更稳定且样本质量更优的训练方式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc37de8db" id="uc37de8db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20L%20%5C%5C%3B%3D%5C%5C%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5CBig%5B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7BKL%7D(q(x_T%7Cx_0)%5C%5C%7Cp(x_T))%7D_%7BL_T%7D%20%5C%5C%3B%2B%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E1%7D%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7BKL%7D(q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t%2Cx_0)%5C%5C%7Cp_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t))%7D_%7BL_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5C%3B-%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%7Cx_1)%7D_%7BL_0%7D%20%5C%5CBig%5D%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c8d0aad8b375c6cc2f13bcc8b805c87.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kI8p6%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uee71a346" id="uee71a346"><strong><span data-lake-id="uea5a2758" id="uea5a2758" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">1️⃣</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ad287b6" id="u6ad287b6" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"> </span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e67087f" id="u6e67087f">在实现里把前向噪声日程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbba9de783a68cad893bf621ff351d81.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nANdU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4ae9702e" id="u4ae9702e">固定为常数，于是没有可训练参数，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_T%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5fb0f2f7a67a906fb28586720c5f4cd6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M8Tuu%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u054a774f" id="u054a774f">在训练时是常数项，直接忽略</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u63e8b635" id="u63e8b635"><span data-lake-id="ue1651c1d" id="ue1651c1d">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ub63e687b" id="ub63e687b"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u81a32304" id="u81a32304">把</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1dd7f756671555569459cbb73be04105.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nFpfl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ude4a946e" id="ude4a946e">的 KL 变成均值回归</span></strong></p><ol list="ue50a0eb0"><li fid="ub665c191" data-lake-id="u817dca95" id="u817dca95"><span data-lake-id="u666f8cb6" id="u666f8cb6">先固定反向方差，只学均值，并把协方差固定成各向同性常数， 把训练重点集中到如何预测均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4151fae1392710b9db51464c8104f646.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gxGXg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9ef7e11" id="ue9ef7e11">上。首先，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff14d9b228887c0c3a67cc0584292cf27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pRQjg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5847aad" id="ua5847aad"> 设为不参与训练的、随时间变化的常数。设定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bor%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d435a1e026f7f66e196f674870fbcde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fETEJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u401830e8" id="u401830e8">都得到相似的结果</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u850c1e6e" id="u850c1e6e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmu_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_t%2C%20t)%2C%20%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_t%2C%20t))%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F393e9a1e95a5d93625ad5dbe565de43d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FhKSF%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ol list="u0151b679" start="2"><li fid="ubb4f0970" data-lake-id="ud4ac86cb" id="ud4ac86cb"><span data-lake-id="u1f4a5e13" id="u1f4a5e13"> 把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F177eb18536b3d0d3edae6832d586fb27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22floqh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91593917" id="u91593917">写成均值回归，让网络输出的均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1df559737e2fc9d6d7f15a1fe181c349.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eRz8E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f2976df" id="u7f2976df">去拟合真实后验均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%5C%5Cmu_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F45ca2cb7374c8be112830ee9a578bf5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O8EDA%22%7D"></card></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u0c9fa277" id="u0c9fa277" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7Bq(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_t%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20I%5C%5Cright).%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f612152269b7099ac9c19d867a17f9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y6Lak%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u40551206" id="u40551206" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_q%5C%5CBig%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Ctilde%5C%5Cmu_t(x_t%2Cx_0)-%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5C%5CBig%5D%2BC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2ccb1d63337b68c6834ce66d9f75fc0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wXkkd%22%7D"></card></p><ol list="u032b000f" start="3"><li fid="ua2f29c60" data-lake-id="uf18c3b47" id="uf18c3b47"><span data-lake-id="ua4c2285d" id="ua4c2285d">把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qC9Mw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua43d981e" id="ua43d981e">用噪声重参数化写出来，把预测后验均值转成预测噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q5Hqj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud180a9a3" id="ud180a9a3">的问题</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="ub0c156d5" id="ub0c156d5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t(x_0%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2Cx_0%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc3b347801d74fb1e23aa8bdb2bec5a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nijtF%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u633952b2" id="u633952b2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa793ddfcef810f8be222c6584ecf7c2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HH7NM%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u646672d4" id="u646672d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4503a35550bf2c788a8a5311904fca3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gd2zM%22%7D"></card></p><ol list="uc3b82c5d" start="4"><li fid="udcd77bea" data-lake-id="udaf7fd95" id="udaf7fd95"><span data-lake-id="uebab1978" id="uebab1978" style="color: #000000">把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F177eb18536b3d0d3edae6832d586fb27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OkXn3%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a38cc6c" id="u7a38cc6c" style="color: #000000">写成只依赖</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20(x_0%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcdfc14e06ed2fa536e3e401e96a7798.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SS8fL%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u811ff547" id="u811ff547" style="color: #000000">的形式， </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F587c2c723cf70b744693be945226d50d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JBXOB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8b91cac" id="ud8b91cac" style="color: #000000">必须在给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1776ece6381f55b4d664d5ecb013bebf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fojPI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub51a680b" id="ub51a680b" style="color: #000000">的情况下预测一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6742e9d7880d4f24760074ef7737769.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MNrEG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6fa6b70a" id="u6fa6b70a" style="color: #000000">的量。不直接学</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1df559737e2fc9d6d7f15a1fe181c349.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p0Bt9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93383a43" id="u93383a43" style="color: #000000">，而是让网络学</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda3fbe41e3aebd072dead9514b1b262e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YBuuK%22%7D"></card></li></ol><p data-lake-id="uaa8d2173" id="uaa8d2173" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnL_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20C%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D%7D_t%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F461239d4e326aa9b60ff1b866d7ade71.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22By0Y1%22%7D"></card></p><ol list="ue8a3ecbc" start="5"><li fid="uc082f73b" data-lake-id="ua8bb0583" id="ua8bb0583"><strong><span data-lake-id="u72020415" id="u72020415" style="color: #004347">训练目标直接变成多噪声尺度的去噪自编码器 / score matching。 优化一个类似去噪 score matching 的目标，与通过变分推断去拟合一个具有 Langevin dynamics 形式的有限时间采样链边缘分布，本质上是等价的</span></strong></li></ol><p data-lake-id="ufdaf769a" id="ufdaf769a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D%7D_t%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb779e38b1ca6bc90098e4bd24f9265d2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ViEBs%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue9437100" id="ue9437100" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5E2%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%5C%5Calpha_t%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%2C%20t%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86c348ac74c282b0aaf026168247d591.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bTvBs%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ol list="u2905c40f" start="6"><li fid="uec94c341" data-lake-id="ue3e3289f" id="ue3e3289f"><span data-lake-id="uf36f5550" id="uf36f5550">模型将反向过程建模为高斯转移</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%2C%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5a0734475b5651b20e3f93d28570e16.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p9NIb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubfdcdcef" id="ubfdcdcef">，因此一旦网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F61e299d19af64c3544d6c616cc83d54f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nZz17%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2404c9a2" id="u2404c9a2">能够从当前带噪样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oL7bL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u556c5e70" id="u556c5e70">中预测出噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YCWQw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u120feb8d" id="u120feb8d">，就可以先由噪声预测写出反向均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd3c07a2f98c0e02e7f0640d0ec82740f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VN6OR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81a3a79d" id="u81a3a79d">。从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d595f009005a817ba0431fe917bcfeb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Uv8KJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubccfc00f" id="ubccfc00f">采样就等价于：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="ub8cd8eaa" id="ub8cd8eaa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmu%2C%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20I)%20%5C%5Ciff%20x%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmu%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma%20z%2C%20z%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20I).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05a720c3c4c2604198213338b3529bce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XY8HA%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u310b13e7" id="u310b13e7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma_t%20z%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20z%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20I).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e4dfae2f8e915ef9167fa43f4610a77.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d5E0E%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4876e3fe" id="u4876e3fe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1765698645211-e1ed7276-225b-4947-8220-6f4dc32f73e3.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A737.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A196%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1368%2C%22originHeight%22%3A363%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f3f3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b1eie%22%7D"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id="uc77bd207" id="uc77bd207" style="padding-left: 2em"><p data-lake-id="uccf14e3d" id="uccf14e3d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e729a05" id="u9e729a05" style="color: #5C0036">反向过程既可以直接学习后验均值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1a6e14736f9ae81f590745736bc7e155.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TlqNZ%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u211028a8" id="u211028a8" style="color: #5C0036">，也可以等价地改写为学习噪声</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fgWOl%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u45ba1a5b" id="u45ba1a5b" style="color: #5C0036">；作者更倾向于后者，因为这种参数化一方面使采样过程更容易解释为 Langevin dynamics，另一方面也把训练目标化成类似 denoising score matching 的形式。虽然它本质上仍是同一个反向分布的不同参数化，但实验表明，预测</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WVykc%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6868d0c" id="ue6868d0c" style="color: #5C0036">的效果更好</span></strong></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id="u52b46207" id="u52b46207" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774156716051-3912e24d-b5a8-48c4-938a-e5598d2f7d80.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u28704162-e499-4ca0-b12f-c6cc4ae57e5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2f606258-27be-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A382%2C%22height%22%3A237%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A47617%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A531%2C%22originHeight%22%3A329%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22UPREDICTION(BASELINE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A222%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E-EE2(LSIMPLE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A210%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%2CLEARNEDDIAGONALZ%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A209%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%2CLEARNEDDIAGONAL2%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A207%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%2CFIXEDISOTROPICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%2CFIXEDISOTROPICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A262%2C%22width%22%3A193%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EPREDICTION(OURS%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%E4%B8%80PE%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227.67%E5%A3%AB0.13%22%2C%22x%22%3A283%2C%22y%22%3A262%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228.06%E5%A3%AB0.09%22%2C%22x%22%3A285%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBJECTIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%229.46%E5%A3%AB0.11%22%2C%22x%22%3A280%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227.28%E5%A3%AB0.10%22%2C%22x%22%3A285%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2223.69%22%2C%22x%22%3A445%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2213.51%22%2C%22x%22%3A446%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2213.22%22%2C%22x%22%3A446%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FID%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223.17%22%2C%22x%22%3A450%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.0104%2C0.0167%2C1%2C0.9791%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e8e8e8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y14fw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8bc69f30" id="u8bc69f30"><span data-lake-id="u5d613cc2" id="u5d613cc2">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u04c166c4" id="u04c166c4"> 最后一步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_0%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8d7759cde800fecb00381be284824b7e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NqgdA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue747a19c" id="ue747a19c">对离散图像进行建模：假设图像数据由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C255%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F999731f01cf74215272b9bb92418daf5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jrxo3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1474b290" id="u1474b290">中的整数像素组成，并将其线性缩放到区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B-1%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe3df4a9071091f59883ac4edb91796f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BDPNQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda518fff" id="uda518fff">。这样做可以保证反向过程中的神经网络从标准高斯先验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x_T)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e52090299a080c187857276f025bc6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uyBc9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5ef7321" id="ud5ef7321">出发时，始终处理尺度一致的输入。为获得离散形式的对数似然，将反向过程的最后一项设为一个由高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(x%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_1%2C1)%2C%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%20I%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F326130da8c8fc79a909a79ccd89a4277.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wTrfr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ac55fb7" id="u3ac55fb7">导出的独立离散解码器，即</span></p><ul list="u90a88c39"><li fid="u322229e4" data-lake-id="u4c79f97f" id="u4c79f97f"><span data-lake-id="u685bb8a8" id="u685bb8a8">前面</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6bad1212292211d80f2f649c77d46187.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q8DUk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1db907e" id="ue1db907e">的各步都在连续空间里做高斯转移。但真实数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gmcsJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub413aa51" id="ub413aa51">本质是离散像素格点，直接用连续高斯密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x_0%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49db4132ffc7111db2c46b475d82e79a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rsqL3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1dbbeba5" id="u1dbbeba5">去当作离散概率，会出现离散似然不对齐的问题</span></li><li fid="u322229e4" data-lake-id="uc4258139" id="uc4258139"><span data-lake-id="u6a0f51cc" id="u6a0f51cc">把最后一步定义成</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud65d8f7d" id="ud65d8f7d">离散化高斯解码器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8d1f5dd2" id="u8d1f5dd2">：对每个维度（每个像素通道）把连续高斯在对应 bin 上的概率质量积分出来，并且假设各维独立</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub3fc0ed0" id="ub3fc0ed0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Cdelta%5E-(x_0%5Ei)%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cdelta%5E%2B(x_0%5Ei)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbig(x%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%5Ei(x_1%2C1)%2C%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5C%2Cdx%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fceb1c44b7ccca5af678a297559181895.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YXWuo%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u03ab1c46" id="u03ab1c46" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_%2B(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cinfty%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20x%20%3D%201%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20x%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B255%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20x%20%3C%201%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cdelta_-(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20-%5C%5Cinfty%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20x%20%3D%20-1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20x%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B255%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20x%20%3E%20-1%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24ad9efdffd01924a951bca4a41cbf2c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HIAlH%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u93db202d"><li fid="u9585d1dc" data-lake-id="ufe15c5f5" id="ufe15c5f5"><span data-lake-id="u886e2103" id="u886e2103">保证变分下界对应于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u398d4910" id="u398d4910">离散数据的无损编码长度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7cb43e1d" id="u7cb43e1d">，而无需额外向数据中加入噪声，也不需要在对数似然中显式引入缩放操作的 Jacobian 项。在采样结束时，直接无噪声地输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_1%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48201e2d0c6eb2aca7f6d0866b5684f3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yEVfF%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u18b14abc" id="u18b14abc"><span data-lake-id="u1f4f049e" id="u1f4f049e">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uc3e6ba35" id="uc3e6ba35"> 在前面已经定义好反向过程和离散解码器之后，完整的变分下界已经可以直接用于训练；但作者发现，从</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf99b781f" id="uf99b781f">样本质量</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufefd1bd0" id="ufefd1bd0">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23e05c61" id="u23e05c61">实现简洁性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0c19bfad" id="u0c19bfad">来看，采用一个更简单的训练目标会更有效。于是，他们提出简化目标  </span></p><p data-lake-id="u38ee4765" id="u38ee4765" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%2C%20t%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5956dcfe8cc81786adcf1e8da3ed3cf5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JGdAd%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uc082fcde" id="uc082fcde"> </span></p><ul list="uf188a39a"><li fid="ub8963984" data-lake-id="ua0633b08" id="ua0633b08"><span data-lake-id="u77a66f29" id="u77a66f29">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06a62ed0aee1140ffbe454a791d04c49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QbDX2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a6d5029" id="u4a6d5029">在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%2C%5C%5Cdots%2CT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff5b11222eafb71e0242e54fb1b64ee8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B0xu4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u838dbd2f" id="u838dbd2f">间均匀采样。这个目标本质上就是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u285505cb" id="u285505cb">随机选一个时间步，把原图加噪得到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mrTlg%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub413af02" id="ub413af02">，再让网络直接预测所加入的噪声</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6742e9d7880d4f24760074ef7737769.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UHrse%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ub8963984" data-lake-id="u02b2a32e" id="u02b2a32e"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8bc596434ea11a3ed4418924838b167.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kZ6eM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94dcc6d8" id="u94dcc6d8">可以理解为对原始变分目标的一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e352c9f" id="u0e352c9f">重加权形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua4f666d4" id="ua4f666d4">。这种简化实际减弱小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y7OLE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d4d82a6" id="u9d4d82a6">时刻损失项的权重。由于小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06a62ed0aee1140ffbe454a791d04c49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gmuiR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubfd6a3e2" id="ubfd6a3e2">对应的是仅含极少噪声的去噪任务，相对较容易；降低其权重后，模型就能把更多能力放在大</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06a62ed0aee1140ffbe454a791d04c49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XrAZ8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73847899" id="u73847899">时更困难的强噪声去噪任务上，从而得到更好的样本生成质量</span></li><li fid="ub8963984" data-lake-id="uc04f2f29" id="uc04f2f29"><span data-lake-id="ubc13e948" id="ubc13e948">在真实的变分下界上训练模型比在简化的目标函数上训练能产生更好的编码长度（对数似然），但后者（简化的目标函数）能产生最好的样本质量</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="RLaWy" id="RLaWy" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u630ee549" id="u630ee549"> </span><span data-lake-id="uf4f715b3" id="uf4f715b3">🦋</span><span data-lake-id="udcf191a6" id="udcf191a6"> 𝑫𝑫𝑷𝑴 𝑻𝒂𝒌𝒆𝒂𝒘𝒂𝒚</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u033d5519" id="u033d5519"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1ca8053d" id="u1ca8053d" style="color: #70000D">DDPM 的流程概括</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5905d708" id="u5905d708">：先固定一个前向扩散（加噪）马尔可夫链</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20q(x_t%5C%5C!%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff884f28c7f98ed8793d0d1f6d45e9286.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PIl6m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf5e56fd" id="uaf5e56fd">，使得任意步的边缘满足</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubaccc106" id="ubaccc106" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%20%7C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)I)%20%5C%5Cimplies%20x_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086e0c5f0c3a54b970c18c7467b10a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VMDVZ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u54dfae46" id="u54dfae46"><span data-lake-id="u5feb4c5e" id="u5feb4c5e">训练时在随机步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06a62ed0aee1140ffbe454a791d04c49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MEgGr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d4e9d65" id="u6d4e9d65">上对数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22te6Li%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2794198f" id="u2794198f">加噪得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G1toZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9cd3c705" id="u9cd3c705">，用网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4bee1fd3cdfbb1e2586f83bf0a2c01e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ROvpr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf83d7551" id="uf83d7551">去预测噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe93300e74073835ec6a8ca7353419eb3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kwg5M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uff81ff80" id="uff81ff80">，最小化加权 MSE 损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum_t%20%5C%5Cgamma_t%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5C%7C%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9abde426d344c6a604250357d6970206.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m4Okh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uddb289ed" id="uddb289ed">。生成时从先验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_T)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39548f94d2bf039bc2c53760a72964c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qovHn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40f8b747" id="u40f8b747">采样得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ggDlB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb5b1339" id="udb5b1339">，再用学到的反向条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ad73a96b82086e6b822baca66d519ea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gkzam%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubca93411" id="ubca93411">依次迭代</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20T%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3be187853663338b742cc84bbecc75fc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qa77F%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u709d2925" id="u709d2925">次把噪声逐步去噪为样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S19Kq%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc7ec470c"><li fid="u5b3bb496" data-lake-id="uc57734a3" id="uc57734a3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c0a9e76" id="u4c0a9e76">前向后验分布，给定</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zJM05%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5836f5f" id="ub5836f5f">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gjGgU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue9c7bc15" id="ue9c7bc15">时，前向后验仍然是高斯分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4ee2938a" id="u4ee2938a">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36dd48af" id="u36dd48af" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%7C%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20I)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%26%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05ab3bd2dd2ee69cc890a29c36f3f11c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E08fM%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0fb51322"><li fid="u119cdbed" data-lake-id="u4b0ca464" id="u4b0ca464"><strong><span data-lake-id="u98c6ba68" id="u98c6ba68">DDPM 最经典的 ϵ-prediction 参数化均值公式</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3e827005" id="u3e827005" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff438b137f72e7cb75d13a32a9f942176.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22znnMm%22%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="smbwP" id="smbwP" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uebfb4717" id="uebfb4717">🦥</span><span data-lake-id="u693aeab0" id="u693aeab0"> 𝐈𝐦𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐯𝐞𝐝 𝐃𝐃𝐏𝐌</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u656f34ee" id="u656f34ee"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4ec9fbac" id="u4ec9fbac">去噪扩散概率模型是一类生成模型，近期已被证明能够生成高质量样本。通过若干简单的改进，DDPM 不仅能够在保持较高样本质量的同时取得具有竞争力的对数似然表现，而且还具备更好的实用性。此外，我们发现学习反向扩散过程的方差可以在样本质量几乎不受影响的前提下，将采样所需的前向传播次数减少一个数量级，这对于此类模型的实际部署尤为重要</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ucab980f4" id="ucab980f4"><span data-lake-id="u4cb5f671" id="u4cb5f671">Sohl-Dickstein 等提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0deb478" id="ue0deb478">扩散概率模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucf20fcfd" id="ucf20fcfd">，这是一类通过学习逆转一个逐步加噪的多步过程来拟合数据分布的生成模型。随后，Ho 等指出，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e05a09c" id="u7e05a09c">去噪扩散概率模型与基于分数的生成模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uea3ca732" id="uea3ca732">之间存在等价关系；后者通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u614e34c3" id="u614e34c3">去噪分数匹配</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u75444731" id="u75444731">来学习数据分布对数密度的梯度。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u04b4a632" id="u04b4a632" style="color: #70000D">DDPM 是否能够在对数似然上达到与其他基于似然的模型和变分自编码器相当的水平，尚未得到证明</span></strong></p><ul list="uf435c812"><li fid="u7107e94d" data-lake-id="u0f965a83" id="u0f965a83"><span data-lake-id="u20003fcc" id="u20003fcc">DDPM 是否具备捕获数据分布全部模态的能力</span></li><li fid="u7107e94d" data-lake-id="u67572c9e" id="u67572c9e"><span data-lake-id="ubf13d7bf" id="ubf13d7bf">DDPM 在诸如 ImageNet 这类具有更高多样性的数据集上的扩展能力仍不明确</span></li><li fid="u7107e94d" data-lake-id="ua1a19df4" id="ua1a19df4"><span data-lake-id="u31547adc" id="u31547adc">DDPM 虽然能够通过较少的采样步数高效生成音频，但这一性质是否同样适用于图像生成，尚未被验证</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufdbd832f" id="ufdbd832f"><span data-lake-id="u8e8390ac" id="u8e8390ac">作者表明，即使是在 ImageNet 这类具有高度数据多样性的数据集上，DDPM 仍能够取得与其他似然模型相当的对数似然性能。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u286aa3d8" id="u286aa3d8" style="color: #004347">为更紧密地优化变分下界（VLB），作者采用一种简单的重参数化方法来学习反向扩散过程的方差，并进一步提出一种混合学习目标，将 VLB 与 Ho 等人提出的简化训练目标结合起来</span></strong></p><ul list="u3a5cd6f5"><li fid="u2ec7f037" data-lake-id="ud93bd930" id="ud93bd930"><span data-lake-id="ue443191c" id="ue443191c">采用该混合目标进行训练时，模型获得的对数似然优于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5e14b5d" id="uf5e14b5d">直接优化 VLB</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf31fff51" id="uf31fff51"> 时的表现</span></li><li fid="u2ec7f037" data-lake-id="ud5e35571" id="ud5e35571"><strong><span data-lake-id="u66c792f1" id="u66c792f1">直接优化 VLB</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9de261ee" id="u9de261ee"> 在训练过程中会引入更大的梯度噪声。进一步地，作者证明一种简单的重要性采样策略能够有效降低</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u27391fc1" id="u27391fc1">直接优化 VLB 所带来的梯度噪声</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9a78ae02" id="u9a78ae02">，并使模型在对数似然方面取得优于混合目标的性能</span></li><li fid="u2ec7f037" data-lake-id="u48ed5b7b" id="u48ed5b7b"><span data-lake-id="u741e0802" id="u741e0802">在反向扩散过程中引入可学习方差后，模型能够在几乎不损失样本质量的前提下，以显著更少的采样步数完成生成 </span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="ubuVJ" id="ubuVJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9e44382e" id="u9e44382e">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u157792bd" id="u157792bd"> 𝑫𝒆𝒏𝒐𝒊𝒔𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒃𝒂𝒃𝒊𝒍𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒄 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5f7545ab" id="u5f7545ab"><span data-lake-id="uadf50f50" id="uadf50f50">给定数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8ec1fd51c7226588dc1c1d241da70d9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ql8K5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46dc5336" id="u46dc5336">，定义一个前向加噪过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pcWCj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u08922010" id="u08922010">。该过程通过逐步加入高斯噪声，生成从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AcENw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc36f4470" id="uc36f4470">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PWRd2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub4bc9e5b" id="ub4bc9e5b">的潜变量，其中在时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jqpqL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e0d1f78" id="u8e0d1f78">加入的噪声方差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cin%20(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c8404f11fb6948074e45084c72f62f0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AuWfv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9211ac79" id="u9211ac79">，形式如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="uded987f0" id="uded987f0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnq(x_1%2C%20%5C%5Cdots%2C%20x_T%20%7C%20x_0)%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20q(x_t%20%7C%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnq(x_t%20%7C%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8889283645087ddabd718a6e27c72a7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OKds1%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u609269cd" id="u609269cd"><span data-lake-id="ub826f1a3" id="ub826f1a3">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22THTd8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc086e4f6" id="uc086e4f6">足够大且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mTkAB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79bb80ee" id="u79bb80ee">的调度设计合理时，潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pAa2G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub4295d2d" id="ub4295d2d">将近似服从各向同性高斯分布。因此，如果已知精确的反向分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F15eb89bf15af4d8159683bf69e9cde8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z4Fnp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03771865" id="u03771865">，则可以先从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3bd39c8557f2f826e8a2f3f553cd1aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FL09e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a23453e" id="u2a23453e">中采样，再沿反向过程逐步生成，从而得到来自</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b4f6cc766f59ade1f1ea158be5ac608.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i8VWY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0484882" id="ub0484882">的样本。然而，由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F15eb89bf15af4d8159683bf69e9cde8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WkzVy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud03bf4ae" id="ud03bf4ae">依赖于整个数据分布，其精确形式通常不可得，因此使用神经网络对其进行近似建模：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufce0057b" id="ufce0057b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%7C%20x_t)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%2C%20%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t))%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c544abccfaf32fe01dcc25426588116.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t4ryW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub77298e7" id="ub77298e7"><span data-lake-id="u605d2f04" id="u605d2f04">由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aDmLB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2d1e08fd" id="u2d1e08fd">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iZzey%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ea2d75c" id="u9ea2d75c">共同构成的模型可以视为一种变分自编码器，其变分下界可写为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf4a18fd5" id="uf4a18fd5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnL_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bvlb%7D%7D%20%26%3A%3D%20L_0%20%2B%20L_1%20%2B%20%5C%5Cdots%20%2B%20L_%7BT-1%7D%20%2B%20L_T%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnL_0%20%26%3A%3D%20-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%7Cx_1)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnL_%7Bt-1%7D%20%26%3A%3D%20D_%7BKL%7D(q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t%2C%20x_0)%20%5C%5Cparallel%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t))%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnL_T%20%26%3A%3D%20D_%7BKL%7D(q(x_T%7Cx_0)%20%5C%5Cparallel%20p(x_T))%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0da099ff3705d2841b1de05104490ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JzONN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uec63c573" id="uec63c573"><span data-lake-id="u661e2b8c" id="u661e2b8c">除</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0b3146aa84eeda704e70d3a1d7c3cde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LlJgQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35ba33c1" id="u35ba33c1">外，每一项都是两个高斯分布之间的 KL 散度，因此都可以写成闭式形式。对于图像数据中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0b3146aa84eeda704e70d3a1d7c3cde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SPZZq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a43fba2" id="u7a43fba2">，作者假设每个颜色通道被离散为 256 个区间，并计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93fa5f34e1b10b18e79b4280e8a4b477.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cGyzM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05dc042c" id="u05dc042c">落入正确区间的概率；这一过程可借助高斯分布的累积分布函数（CDF）高效实现。另需注意，虽然</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a190ff1f2a45ed46e756587cac6d7dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22msAmN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2849a2ef" id="u2849a2ef">与参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f8f02fd1006c7ebfd3af79fe298d78e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N6x46%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc78353d6" id="uc78353d6">无关，但若前向加噪过程足以充分破坏原始数据分布，使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_T%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ddd3b8b1da5262a124c36e51f88f2d3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wTgTa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u692596d5" id="u692596d5">，则该项将接近于零</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua8a66aaf" id="ua8a66aaf"><span data-lake-id="ud04057f7" id="ud04057f7">正如 Ho 等所指出的，定义的加噪过程允许我们在给定输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AbQ87%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae1a074a" id="uae1a074a">的条件下，直接采样任意时间步的加噪潜变量</span></p><p data-lake-id="u26175677" id="u26175677" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%20%26%3A%3D%201%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bs%3D1%7D%5Et%20%5C%5Calpha_s%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnq(x_t%7Cx_0)%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7Dx_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F10c49c9c130a1f1472e48273420a430f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MyAdi%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u141ffbda" id="u141ffbda"><span data-lake-id="u7c7db396" id="u7c7db396">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5ee915935fbcdf24d728c691a3ddebb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w0V7m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3ad7717" id="ud3ad7717">表示任意时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mOH3p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc53e173c" id="uc53e173c">下噪声的方差。因此，也可以用这一量来定义噪声调度，而不必直接以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vuJF9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1264c71c" id="u1264c71c">为参数。利用贝叶斯定理，可以将后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb55cddbbfa738c89e3b14c3c62eed1a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kAXvk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc6fcffcb" id="uc6fcffcb">表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbef521579d1de7ae8ce0a8122661602.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l7Nne%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b553b2e" id="u0b553b2e">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2Cx_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93b5ceef6f869099a37c2a63855bce8c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D5buA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1e8dca0" id="ua1e8dca0">的函数</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua254ce6f" id="ua254ce6f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_t%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnq(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t%2C%20x_0)%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85a85e38b7186b7125dd2e8fb076b9ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eRt9Q%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7c75d54d" id="u7c75d54d"><span data-lake-id="uc2b97832" id="uc2b97832">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3e5573e85d368d27c214d4781590b09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q9hAx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua00664df" id="ua00664df">的参数化，有多种不同方式。最直接的方法是使用神经网络直接预测</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3e5573e85d368d27c214d4781590b09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lAQdl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f68c5d5" id="u5f68c5d5">。另一种方式是令网络预测</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZpxWn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u142d9685" id="u142d9685">，再将该输出代入上式以得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3e5573e85d368d27c214d4781590b09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NMO44%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u074a79e4" id="u074a79e4">。此外，网络也可以预测加入到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FQrmk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77c8b3a1" id="u77c8b3a1">上的噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a2YJ5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf41541f" id="ubf41541f">，并基于下式恢复</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22liLp9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8ed2a1c2" id="u8ed2a1c2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c6f96660513d2db765039e4bca71d93.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ieA2u%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0f9919e3" id="u0f9919e3"><span data-lake-id="u780acff4" id="u780acff4">Ho 等发现，预测噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XCVeT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud99aea1a" id="ud99aea1a">的效果最好，尤其是在结合重加权损失函数时更为明显：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5134ab89" id="u5134ab89" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsimple%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2Cx_0%2C%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cepsilon-%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F332c1e267f33381996f4a7831c646f68.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FUjbY%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucf815b10" id="ucf815b10"><span data-lake-id="ua4ad5775" id="ua4ad5775">该目标可以视为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6e687dbb4a0188fa15a55c24e816bcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F1tOk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2eee41b4" id="u2eee41b4">的一种重加权形式，其中不包含影响</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd4058407ebd1a5778365eaa608fa2de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MeB04%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5dbe05a4" id="u5dbe05a4">的项。与直接优化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6e687dbb4a0188fa15a55c24e816bcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ri5jG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2439388" id="ub2439388">相比，优化这一重加权目标能够显著提升生成样本的质量。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e4cb92a583015033d46e1802ab516a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rnyKx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud62d2ac6" id="ud62d2ac6">并不会为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9f1d4732c8a7afd9d900e13e63e066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pzk4i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04887cc2" id="u04887cc2">提供学习信号。然而，这一点并不会造成实际问题，因为 Ho 等取得最佳结果时，并未学习方差，而是将其固定为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d4d99134edc37084f10f77e11e99692.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AFYao%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ba3163f" id="u0ba3163f">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0c8093d" id="ue0c8093d">当取</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%3D%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe61b4f9742690cd011ca3c75d22b4584.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iqnrg%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ce1d7d7" id="u6ce1d7d7">或</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%3D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd76a9169d379ed01ebc75ddfd53e776.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oC4rX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua6e87ac7" id="ua6e87ac7">时，模型都能够获得相近的样本质量。这两个取值分别对应于由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b4f6cc766f59ade1f1ea158be5ac608.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CLnum%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue99096fc" id="ue99096fc">为各向同性高斯噪声或退化为狄拉克 delta 分布时所给出的方差上界与下界</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="Fqc1M" id="Fqc1M" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uf809b2a6" id="uf809b2a6">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="uf428eaf1" id="uf428eaf1"> 𝑰𝒎𝒑𝒓𝒐𝒗𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝑳𝒐𝒈-𝒍𝒊𝒌𝒆𝒍𝒊𝒉𝒐𝒐𝒅</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u80f2cae5" id="u80f2cae5"><span data-lake-id="ue05db07d" id="ue05db07d">尽管 DDPM 在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u53d50a7b" id="u53d50a7b">FID</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufd674648" id="ufd674648"> 和 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufda4ca7f" id="ufda4ca7f">Inception Score</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u25b069b1" id="u25b069b1"> 等指标上能够生成高保真样本，但未能使该模型取得具有竞争力的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7c27d09b" id="u7c27d09b">对数似然</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0ec60ebf" id="u0ec60ebf">表现。对数似然是生成建模中广泛采用的一项评价指标，通常认为，对对数似然的优化会迫使生成模型捕获数据分布中的全部模态。此外，近期研究表明，即便是对数似然上的微小提升，也可能对样本质量和所学习到的特征表征产生显著影响</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub07e4e32" id="ub07e4e32"><span data-lake-id="u91c15c20" id="u91c15c20">在 Ho 等人的工作中，设定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%3D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ae2940b90625cd201fb10390df3d1fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aV4qH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15ef6d5c" id="u15ef6d5c">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e2506947b69895932952b76205d5ef4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RAan1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1418818e" id="u1418818e">并不是通过学习得到的。将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e2506947b69895932952b76205d5ef4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sA7XN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u270c41c6" id="u270c41c6">固定为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbba9de783a68cad893bf621ff351d81.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fcsHc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d460e8d" id="u8d460e8d">或固定为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59838dfeec3324da4779eb2dc4d9aece.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IZsKB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52e61883" id="u52e61883">，两者都能够得到大致相同的样本质量。考虑到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BH8so%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa46ece4" id="ufa46ece4">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59838dfeec3324da4779eb2dc4d9aece.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ougo0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0615e9f8" id="u0615e9f8">分别代表两个相反的极端，自然会引出一个问题：为什么这一选择几乎不会影响生成样本？</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3ea7ac9e" id="u3ea7ac9e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776141685761-4b53bb7c-03ba-4f8b-84a2-a383462ed582.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5f6a6e46-906f-4b41-b33a-eca10ea2988%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8b39a32e-0284-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A445.81817626953125%2C%22height%22%3A271%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A36390%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A976%2C%22originHeight%22%3A594%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DIFFUSIONSTEP(T%2FT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A447%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%E4%B8%80100STEPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A740%2C%22y%22%3A408%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%E4%B8%8910000STEPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A743%2C%22y%22%3A473%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%E4%B8%891000STEPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A744%2C%22y%22%3A442%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226X10-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A195%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223X10-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A733%2C%22y%22%3A530%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A530%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A312%2C%22y%22%3A530%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A172%2C%22y%22%3A531%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A549%2C%22y%22%3A531%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A453%2C%22y%22%3A533%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A105%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224X10-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A329%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udfb015b4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf762b826" id="uf762b826"><span data-lake-id="u1bbe40d8" id="u1bbe40d8">图中表明，除在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bGKfI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb1fc5e3" id="ucb1fc5e3">附近以外，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lq9zU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5706b75b" id="u5706b75b">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59838dfeec3324da4779eb2dc4d9aece.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xmp9W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40a5651b" id="u40a5651b">几乎相等；而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h6qvo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02149364" id="u02149364">附近恰恰对应模型仅需处理一些几乎不可感知细节的阶段。此外，随着扩散步数的增加，在更大范围的扩散过程中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MNZsv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1afed255" id="u1afed255">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F269980ecbc11314dc85fa7d10e5a7dcc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gH0IW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1cfdb84" id="ue1cfdb84">似乎始终保持彼此接近。这表明，在扩散步数趋于无穷的极限情况下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47db06c23eda0f320721582da4e8a231.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EmMBT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0be25274" id="u0be25274">的具体选择对于样本质量可能根本不会产生显著影响。随着扩散步数不断增加，模型均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3e5573e85d368d27c214d4781590b09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EfG1T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u561538f6" id="u561538f6">对最终分布的决定作用将远强于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9f1d4732c8a7afd9d900e13e63e066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZbrHq%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2a1d0579" id="u2a1d0579" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776141839734-b1358fec-cfd1-462e-8927-db805e2e8d8f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua2371c1e-f072-4cb6-8afa-2e1cd7b034c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u772259ff-f231-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A416.2727355957031%2C%22height%22%3A269%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A34768%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A967%2C%22originHeight%22%3A625%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A328%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A6%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A199%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A174%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IFFUSIONSTEP%22%2C%22x%22%3A469%2C%22y%22%3A593%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222500%22%2C%22x%22%3A595%2C%22y%22%3A560%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223000%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A560%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22000%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A560%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224000%22%2C%22x%22%3A870%2C%22y%22%3A560%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223500%22%2C%22x%22%3A777%2C%22y%22%3A559%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221500%22%2C%22x%22%3A412%2C%22y%22%3A559%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222000%22%2C%22x%22%3A499%2C%22y%22%3A559%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210-%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A74%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A78%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22500%22%2C%22x%22%3A235%2C%22y%22%3A560%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A114%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A212%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A94%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210-%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A421%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2248%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A129%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0285056b%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub715d738" id="ub715d738"><span data-lake-id="uffb66cbf" id="uffb66cbf">扩散过程中的最初若干步对变分下界的贡献最大。因此，使用更优的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9f1d4732c8a7afd9d900e13e63e066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E6P1N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4fd4d1f" id="ud4fd4d1f">选择，很可能会提升模型的对数似然表现。为实现这一目标，需要在避免 Ho 等人所遇到训练不稳定问题的前提下，对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9f1d4732c8a7afd9d900e13e63e066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gjhSO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9595c3cb" id="u9595c3cb">进行学习。即便是在对数域中，直接让神经网络预测</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9f1d4732c8a7afd9d900e13e63e066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yBApt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u508b593b" id="u508b593b">也是困难的。相比之下将方差参数化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yyD99%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u68053bbb" id="u68053bbb">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59838dfeec3324da4779eb2dc4d9aece.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ejkeL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9d2c26a" id="ub9d2c26a">在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1cb98e02" id="u1cb98e02">对数域中的插值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5d5bf4fa" id="u5d5bf4fa">会更加有效</span></p><p data-lake-id="u141036ae" id="u141036ae" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp(v%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%2B%20(1%20-%20v)%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab27e0cce32944c228b34145ba87a5de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ta1sa%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3ce5cd67" id="u3ce5cd67"><span data-lake-id="uf883b5bf" id="uf883b5bf">由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8bc596434ea11a3ed4418924838b167.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WDN3r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e803336" id="u3e803336">不依赖于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9f1d4732c8a7afd9d900e13e63e066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OXjqX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc612288f" id="uc612288f">，进一步定义一个新的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2657b8f6" id="u2657b8f6">混合目标函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8930ddfc" id="u8930ddfc">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u66e7019a" id="u66e7019a" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u05f91cae" id="u05f91cae">  </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bhybrid%7D%7D%20%3D%20L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Clambda%20L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bvlb%7D%7D%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff9cf61ab74e934ec553c1099210c43e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jfFTd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9584147a" id="u9584147a"><span data-lake-id="u871f869f" id="u871f869f">在实验中取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Clambda%3D0.001%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0fa306addc5e29ab0549dade9edc3a4e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DsBPT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae117eb2" id="uae117eb2">，以避免</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fee42ec9145fe33d92388ef4e2b3bda27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ReZZn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uabb5de28" id="uabb5de28">在优化过程中压倒</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8bc596434ea11a3ed4418924838b167.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qjXq0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb1928c8" id="ucb1928c8">。基于相同的考虑，还对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fee42ec9145fe33d92388ef4e2b3bda27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QVLtF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72e8ee00" id="u72e8ee00">项中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3e5573e85d368d27c214d4781590b09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eTSKU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uff53e6fa" id="uff53e6fa">输出施加 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubcaf816e" id="ubcaf816e">stop-gradient</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue71987cc" id="ue71987cc"> 操作。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fee42ec9145fe33d92388ef4e2b3bda27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YBVY4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9998f7f" id="ub9998f7f">主要用于指导</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9f1d4732c8a7afd9d900e13e63e066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YTnYZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f913bae" id="u0f913bae">的学习，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3e5573e85d368d27c214d4781590b09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yYFVE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0fd426c" id="ue0fd426c">的优化仍然主要由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8bc596434ea11a3ed4418924838b167.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b5tK1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u379266fa" id="u379266fa">所主导</span></p><p data-lake-id="u33294419" id="u33294419"><span data-lake-id="u46864241" id="u46864241">尽管 Ho 等所采用的线性噪声调度在高分辨率图像上表现良好，但对于分辨率为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u035347c2" id="u035347c2">64×64</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u922faf19" id="u922faf19"> 和 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue7dc123f" id="ue7dc123f">32×32</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub6f0b3d9" id="ub6f0b3d9"> 的图像而言，该调度并非最优。具体而言，在这类较低分辨率下，前向加噪过程末端所引入的噪声过强，因此对最终样本质量的贡献十分有限。当使用线性调度训练模型时，即使跳过反向扩散过程中的最多 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa3d6fc2" id="uaa3d6fc2">20%</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u583aa1d8" id="u583aa1d8"> 步骤，模型性能（以 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7d148525" id="u7d148525">FID</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5ec0605f" id="u5ec0605f"> 衡量）也不会显著下降。为解决这一问题，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0705f3af54238c828566399c26f92e1c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kFP7W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26370f37" id="u26370f37">为基础重新构造一种新的噪声调度方式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u595e53a0" id="u595e53a0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bf(t)%7D%7Bf(0)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20f(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ccos%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%2FT%20%2B%20s%7D%7B1%20%2B%20s%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%26%3D%201%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F469864bffab1a95fdc0657e4127ecf6b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Go5lC%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u55b7b817" id="u55b7b817"><strong><span data-lake-id="u75314cb4" id="u75314cb4">余弦调度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u86351c28" id="u86351c28">旨在使</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0705f3af54238c828566399c26f92e1c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iiRtt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73e32285" id="u73e32285">在扩散过程的中段呈现近似线性的下降趋势，而在两端</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nD308%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u289bd6e8" id="u289bd6e8">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3DT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8327b3b12defea7a27228e80772e8d03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aPeH9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u609130be" id="u609130be">附近变化较为缓慢，从而避免噪声水平发生突变。引入一个较小的偏移量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yVrO6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uacbcaad8" id="uacbcaad8">，以防止在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ornfM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31932294" id="u31932294">附近</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K1rNH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26fd0715" id="u26fd0715">过小。若在扩散过程开始阶段噪声量过于微弱，网络将难以实现足够精确的预测。选择</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nDN5z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e9547a3" id="u9e9547a3">使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_0%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfb2b6887f646294c9655f7abca0b751.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NsF9q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2eac1469" id="u2eac1469">略小于像素离散区间宽度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%2F127.5%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb67234281bcdb022c2ff736de3be0844.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wdg1C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7accfaca" id="u7accfaca">，由此得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D0.008%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4bb00549f6caa64a49c1acff19199ce7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MPrMj%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u474c73d5" id="u474c73d5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776143341003-37f2cfe8-967a-4224-99f5-4ded8fccb46e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9ff02882-6636-444c-96be-cdb11f74cab%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5ca1025b-eaae-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A367.8182067871094%2C%22height%22%3A251%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A33688%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A844%2C%22originHeight%22%3A575%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DIFFUSIONSTEPTT%22%2C%22x%22%3A360%2C%22y%22%3A545%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COSINE%22%2C%22x%22%3A746%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A747%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A639%2C%22y%22%3A514%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A515%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A514%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A772%2C%22y%22%3A514%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A515%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A293%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A365%2C%22y%22%3A514%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A469%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf9f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u916a4b70%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u45508013" id="u45508013"><span data-lake-id="u7441ac72" id="u7441ac72">原本预期，通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc312e939" id="uc312e939">直接优化变分下界</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6e687dbb4a0188fa15a55c24e816bcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NV1Mo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d9b11ba" id="u8d9b11ba">而非优化混合目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhybrid%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffac2bf05f18d4f0f1f49163c53109222.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SDnIN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31e2fa29" id="u31e2fa29">，能够获得最佳的对数似然表现。在实际训练中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6e687dbb4a0188fa15a55c24e816bcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GcSA3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u469e1b51" id="u469e1b51">的优化过程相当困难。尽管两条曲线都表现出一定噪声，但在相同训练时间下，混合目标在训练集上显然能够取得更优的对数似然结果</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf4720455" id="uf4720455" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776143694896-9938aa0f-050b-4226-ac0e-832226d21e98.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub290d9aa-e42e-4f46-8150-af3e20861ad%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5ca1025b-eaae-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A427.4545593261719%2C%22height%22%3A270%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A66807%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A871%2C%22originHeight%22%3A551%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A65%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A306%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAININGITERATIONS(1E3)%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A516%2C%22width%22%3A247%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A308%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LVLB(RESAMPLED)%22%2C%22x%22%3A623%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A334%2C%22height%22%3A210%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224.75%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VV%22%2C%22x%22%3A163%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A70%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225.00%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22250%22%2C%22x%22%3A782%2C%22y%22%3A486%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A378%2C%22y%22%3A486%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22200%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A486%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223.00%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A461%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22150%22%2C%22x%22%3A508%2C%22y%22%3A486%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LHYBRID%22%2C%22x%22%3A626%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2250%22%2C%22x%22%3A229%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LB%22%2C%22x%22%3A624%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22050100%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A477%2C%22width%22%3A366%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.50%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f6f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9976f82b%22%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776143971384-86b73091-7df5-43a0-9c22-f785124243b5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u418d40ba-a134-44a5-a088-5b1cee3579b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5ca1025b-eaae-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A442.4545593261719%2C%22height%22%3A270%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A27359%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A684%2C%22originHeight%22%3A417%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A164%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A65%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A134%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAININGSTEP(1E3%22%2C%22x%22%3A286%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221001%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LHYBRIA%22%2C%22x%22%3A544%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22175%22%2C%22x%22%3A508%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22150%22%2C%22x%22%3A452%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22105%22%2C%22x%22%3A70%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22125%22%2C%22x%22%3A394%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22104%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22200%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LVIB%22%2C%22x%22%3A543%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2250%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2275%22%2C%22x%22%3A281%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2225%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A123%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf9f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua6ad0ca4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7d48cc89" id="u7d48cc89"><span data-lake-id="u9ce3677d" id="u9ce3677d">作者推测</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6e687dbb4a0188fa15a55c24e816bcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lxAIB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud536efbf" id="ud536efbf">的梯度噪声要显著大于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhybrid%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffac2bf05f18d4f0f1f49163c53109222.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W17CD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f106628" id="u3f106628">的梯度噪声，并进一步评估在两种目标函数下训练所得模型的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u839661c9" id="u839661c9">梯度噪声尺度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud0b56efa" id="ud0b56efa">。因此尝试寻找一种方法，以降低</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6e687dbb4a0188fa15a55c24e816bcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ewubk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1001ceb" id="ub1001ceb">的方差，从而能够更直接地针对对数似然进行优化：在训练过程中对时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SC1fC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6112c361" id="u6112c361">进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7564a49" id="ua7564a49">均匀采样</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0f89cf94" id="u0f89cf94">，会给</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvlb%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6e687dbb4a0188fa15a55c24e816bcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tZ6Wy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5423069" id="ua5423069">的估计引入不必要的噪声。为缓解这一问题，采用重要性采样策略</span></p><p data-lake-id="uec6a3a26" id="uec6a3a26" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bvlb%7D%7D%20%3D%20E_%7Bt%20%5C%5Csim%20p_t%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BL_t%7D%7Bp_t%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20where%20%7D%20p_t%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Csqrt%7BE%5BL_t%5E2%5D%7D%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7D%20%5C%5Csum%20p_t%20%3D%201%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea476086963507cef91d57d0e7829bbd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ylJ1Q%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufaefebe5" id="ufaefebe5"><span data-lake-id="u16542f45" id="u16542f45">由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5BL_t%5E2%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40067f6ccf628f8b4e4c760a9c8e6eb7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n6go7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u072c4f55" id="u072c4f55">在训练开始前是未知的，并且其数值可能会在整个训练过程中不断变化，为每一个损失项维护最近 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d49f6fc" id="u3d49f6fc">10 个历史值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u54f06f4e" id="u54f06f4e">，并在训练过程中动态更新这一统计量。在训练初期，由于尚未积累足够历史信息，先对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WWX9w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u913bcbae" id="u913bcbae">进行均匀采样，直至每个时间步至少被采样 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u703e0afd" id="u703e0afd">10 次</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u083df54c" id="u083df54c"> 为止</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="G6ZDf" id="G6ZDf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9f2ac865" id="u9f2ac865">🐳</span><span data-lake-id="ua8542bbc" id="ua8542bbc"> 𝑰𝒎𝒑𝒓𝒐𝒗𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑺𝒂𝒎𝒑𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑺𝒑𝒆𝒆𝒅  </span></h2><p data-lake-id="udfdc4335" id="udfdc4335"><span data-lake-id="uc5a449ca" id="uc5a449ca">在本节中，所有模型均使用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u42e5d73f" id="u42e5d73f">4000 个扩散步</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2f1e2597" id="u2f1e2597">进行训练，并研究当采样时减少扩散步数后模型性能的变化规律，并发现</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u88da0661" id="u88da0661">预训练的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhybrid%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffac2bf05f18d4f0f1f49163c53109222.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z2So3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u28dcc677" id="u28dcc677">模型无需任何微调，即可在远少于训练时所用步数的条件下生成高质量样本</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u82be29f3" id="u82be29f3">。以这种方式减少采样步数后，模型生成单个样本所需时间可由数分钟缩短至数秒，从而显著提升图像 DDPM 在实际应用中的可行性</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud06be1b4" id="ud06be1b4"><span data-lake-id="u052e5913" id="u052e5913">对于一个使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nRGvc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udabe2eb1" id="udabe2eb1">个扩散步训练得到的模型，通常在采样阶段也会采用与训练时相同的时间步序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(1%2C2%2C%5C%5Cdots%2CT)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5b2d73cd880248546afcc8df1d691783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WZQAd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d33c43b" id="u7d33c43b">。然而，实际上也可以基于任意一个由时间步组成的子序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BS%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09f7f025fe5f9478578a25979ef28135.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nhb1X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4ce6a45" id="ud4ce6a45">进行采样。给定训练阶段的噪声调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0705f3af54238c828566399c26f92e1c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bFXxL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23a4084d" id="u23a4084d">，对于任意给定的子序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BS%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09f7f025fe5f9478578a25979ef28135.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22laQx3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf5346de4" id="uf5346de4">，可以得到相应的采样噪声调度 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7BS_t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8ad362f98fc812dcbe092e781feb6612.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sdVJS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0772e58d" id="u0772e58d">，并进一步由此构造对应的采样方差</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud27c783f" id="ud27c783f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_%7BS_t%7D%3D1-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7BS_t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7BS_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_%7BS_t%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7BS_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7BS_t%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_%7BS_t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F906c5c96df6edb9228ecbdc07aa3e728.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C15po%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u00daadb7" id="u00daadb7"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7BS_t%7D%2CS_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbef48d3041062c4191829af72d1adadd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zDQda%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a75063a" id="u8a75063a">被参数化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_%7BS_t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3997e971e7e92c8c8f89c317406a91bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nkUFx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua252dcb3" id="ua252dcb3">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_%7BS_t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79eaa5ed1f1ccd32e795091b7fdd3276.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zrfF1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7189569" id="ue7189569">之间的一个区间，对于更短的扩散过程，它会自动完成相应的重缩放。便可以将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x_%7BS_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7BS_t%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb604eb32cccaea5468e68de95cb55462.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kFu0a%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4942d18c" id="u4942d18c">写为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7BS_t%7D%2CS_t)%2C%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7BS_t%7D%2CS_t)%5C%5Cbig).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00a742939b3d4b178f733a376995394f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AywCW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u45db7dad" id="u45db7dad">为将采样步数从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LOco8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc94f6a51" id="uc94f6a51">降低为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZN2Bv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61a5cf9f" id="u61a5cf9f">，在区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B1%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc91044cb8d8693093b0f7eed1d09763c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vumx6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a9e8d39" id="u3a9e8d39">上均匀选取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QUxwV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u92abe5ad" id="u92abe5ad">个实数点，再将每个结果四舍五入为最近的整数。评估使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhybrid%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffac2bf05f18d4f0f1f49163c53109222.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iSHpK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u744be1bc" id="u744be1bc">训练的模型和使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e4cb92a583015033d46e1802ab516a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uN1tS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8123c3e2" id="u8123c3e2">训练的模型在不同采样步数下的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud845e655" id="ud845e655">FID</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3080b2bd" id="u3080b2bd"> 表现</span></p><ul list="uf2b1cba5"><li fid="u812002e8" data-lake-id="u4d15d392" id="u4d15d392"><span data-lake-id="uf3517a5a" id="uf3517a5a">使用固定方差的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e4cb92a583015033d46e1802ab516a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zpqMD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufef565aa" id="ufef565aa">模型：无论固定为较大的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%3D%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe61b4f9742690cd011ca3c75d22b4584.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rdkR5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1f2ade23" id="u1f2ade23">，还是较小的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%3D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd76a9169d379ed01ebc75ddfd53e776.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xz5Iv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9382297c" id="u9382297c">。在减少采样步数后，其样本质量都会出现更明显的下降</span></li><li fid="u812002e8" data-lake-id="ufb18e59c" id="ufb18e59c"><span data-lake-id="ub0ca8a9b" id="ub0ca8a9b">所提出的、具有</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u86a5fb05" id="u86a5fb05">可学习方差</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc8b4cbfd" id="uc8b4cbfd">的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhybrid%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffac2bf05f18d4f0f1f49163c53109222.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rAGYz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf04b80b5" id="uf04b80b5">模型则能够较好地维持较高的样本质量。对于该模型而言，仅使用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u649dfa07" id="u649dfa07">100 个采样步</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufeef0be8" id="ufeef0be8">，便足以在已充分训练的模型上取得接近最优的 FID 表现</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4b282578" id="u4b282578"><span data-lake-id="uc1ad2f40" id="uc1ad2f40">在与 GAN 的比较中，作者指出虽然对数似然可以作为衡量模型模态覆盖能力的一个有效代理指标，但并不适合直接用于与 GAN 进行公平比较，因此转而采用 precision 与 recall 作为补充评价指标。为与现有 GAN 工作保持一致，作者将扩散模型构造为类别条件生成模型，并在 ImageNet 64×64 上进行实验。尽管 BigGAN-deep 在 FID 指标上优于其较小规模的扩散模型，但在 recall 指标上表现较差，说明扩散模型在覆盖数据分布的更多模态方面更具优势</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9361e8d0" id="u9361e8d0"><span data-lake-id="udb926ff1" id="udb926ff1">作者进一步研究 DDPM 的性能如何随着模型规模和训练计算量增加而变化。随着训练计算量提升，FID 和 NLL 均呈现改善趋势，其中 FID 在对数坐标下近似满足幂律关系，说明其扩展规律较为平滑且可预测；相比之下，NLL 的扩展性则不如 FID 理想，未能很好符合幂律趋势。作者认为这可能与扩散模型存在较高的不可约损失，或模型对训练分布产生一定过拟合有关</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="FS16t" id="FS16t" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7dd84981" id="u7dd84981">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="uffb53430" id="uffb53430"> 𝐃𝐞𝐧𝐨𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐈𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐭 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ub34c03c8" id="ub34c03c8"><span data-lake-id="uaabe09d6" id="uaabe09d6">去噪扩散概率模型与噪声条件 score 网络表明，即使不依赖对抗训练，也能够生成与生成对抗网络相当质量的样本。这类方法的基本思想是在不同高斯噪声水平下进行去噪学习，使模型从受扰动样本中恢复数据结构；在采样阶段，则从白噪声出发，经由逐步去噪的马尔可夫链生成目标样本。该生成过程通常可建立在 Langevin dynamics 之上，或被解释为前向扩散过程的逆过程。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4c52f97" id="uf4c52f97" style="color: #DF2A3F">但其采样过程通常依赖多步马尔可夫链的逐步反演，因此生成效率仍然受限。为缓解这一问题，论文提出去噪扩散隐式模型，并围绕以下两个方面展开改进</span></strong></p><ul list="uc9d542d1"><li fid="u5805ea5e" data-lake-id="u8f7bd67e" id="u8f7bd67e"><span data-lake-id="u164ff914" id="u164ff914">以</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a301f2c" id="u7a301f2c">提升采样效率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99a4f0f1" id="u99a4f0f1">为核心目标，提出去噪扩散隐式模型这一更高效的迭代式隐式概率生成框架。该方法在保持原有训练流程不变的前提下，实现对传统扩散采样方式的有效加速，因而兼具方法上的兼容性与实践上的高效性</span></li><li fid="u5805ea5e" data-lake-id="u1b4a82d2" id="u1b4a82d2"><span data-lake-id="u0cf6191d" id="u0cf6191d">从</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u56932573" id="u56932573">生成过程的建模方式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u365f706f" id="u365f706f">入手，对去噪扩散概率模型进行推广。传统方法将生成过程定义为特定马尔可夫扩散过程的逆过程，而论文</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue48286a8" id="ue48286a8" style="color: #5C0036">进一步提出一类非马尔可夫扩散过程，并证明其仍可导出与原方法一致的训练目标。进一步地，这类非马尔可夫过程在特定条件下可退化为确定性生成过程，从而使模型能够以更少的采样步数生成高质量样本</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc52cfc2f" id="uc52cfc2f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774258006696-37a6c0fc-766c-4f7d-8587-2836f578837a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubedbf88a-0c95-491f-a39d-372b1526125%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud1ad989b-0061-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A857.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A118%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A63212%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1174%2C%22originHeight%22%3A162%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%224(0302%2C00)%E4%B8%AA4(3201%2C200%22%2C%22x%22%3A661%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A287%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%229(3231)%22%2C%22x%22%3A226%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P0%22%2C%22x%22%3A255%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2200%22%2C%22x%22%3A1109%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PE%22%2C%22x%22%3A868%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A181%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2202%22%2C%22x%22%3A793%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A475%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A330%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AiBY1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b9a7031" id="u5b9a7031"> </span></p><p data-lake-id="u16f6fc77" id="u16f6fc77"><strong><span data-lake-id="u79386ba5" id="u79386ba5">去噪扩散隐式模型可被视为一类隐式概率生成模型，并与去噪扩散概率模型保持紧密联系，其关键在于二者共享相同的训练目标</span></strong></p><ul list="u1da6bfa8"><li fid="u15a0c588" data-lake-id="u18d80f1d" id="u18d80f1d"><span data-lake-id="u8207ca83" id="u8207ca83">将原本马尔可夫形式的前向扩散过程推广为一类非马尔可夫扩散过程，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4654f852" id="u4654f852" style="color: #664900">并证明由此得到的变分训练目标具有共同的代理目标，而该代理目标恰与去噪扩散概率模型的训练目标一致</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u908d8b87" id="u908d8b87">。因此，无需重新训练网络，仅通过选择不同的非马尔可夫扩散过程及其对应的逆向生成链，便可在统一训练框架下构造出一族不同的生成模型</span></li><li fid="u15a0c588" data-lake-id="u20b0336b" id="u20b0336b"><span data-lake-id="uc4939226" id="uc4939226">进一步地，部分非马尔可夫扩散过程能够导出更短的生成链，从而以更少的采样步数完成生成，并在仅带来较小质量损失的情况下显著提升采样效率。特别是在特定条件下，这类过程还可对应于确定性的生成机制，从而赋予去噪扩散隐式模型隐式生成模型的性质</span></li><li fid="u15a0c588" data-lake-id="u8da6366c" id="u8da6366c"><span data-lake-id="u7fe19c68" id="u7fe19c68">相较于去噪扩散概率模型，去噪扩散隐式模型在加速采样时仍能保持较高的样本质量，并在快速采样场景下表现出更优性能。此外，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ba9d604" id="u5ba9d604" style="color: #664900">该模型还具有一致性特征</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2d7065cc" id="u2d7065cc">，即从相同初始潜变量出发、采用不同长度生成链得到的样本，在高层语义上仍具有较强相似性，因此更适合实现具有语义意义的潜空间插值</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="jrM6E" id="jrM6E" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uf3eb5738" id="uf3eb5738">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="ued8d6159" id="ued8d6159"> 𝑩𝑨𝑪𝑲𝑮𝑹𝑶𝑼𝑵𝑫</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5b4f8ade" id="u5b4f8ade"><span data-lake-id="u30d1121a" id="u30d1121a">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ub6478313" id="ub6478313"> 去噪扩散概率模型是一类潜变量模型，核心思想是在观测变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gtp3s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue40a85c9" id="ue40a85c9">之外引入一系列与其处于相同样本空间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18c08d4023d6d8076d054c47b4895d84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NlhIk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u06e80c20" id="u06e80c20">中的潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a1c7149f6cd4b9eaedbe45f54f7cdb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eL31Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3be5914b" id="u3be5914b">，通过对联合分布的建模来刻画数据生成过程</span></p><p data-lake-id="u91fa7c63" id="u91fa7c63" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20%3A%3D%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe89e75a535973c186641635c5e82f2cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kum1s%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1fc4bede" id="u1fc4bede"><span data-lake-id="u89ebd8f8" id="u89ebd8f8">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u1f0b4d63" id="u1f0b4d63"> 模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iqShs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e63eaa6" id="u4e63eaa6">通过最大化数据对数似然的变分下界进行学习，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmax_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_1%2C%20%5C%5Cdots%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%7D%20%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%20%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3d801f6f3dd6bc0b2e66b72b52fe55e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xJLTM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc22a3ae7" id="uc22a3ae7">。其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F728ff608f91e0d6f3ee4cede450684a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UXcd4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u268cad9b" id="u268cad9b">表示潜变量的推断分布。不同于变分自编码器等典型潜变量模型，去噪扩散概率模型中的推断过程通常是预先设定且固定的，而非可学习的；同时，其潜变量通常具有较高维度</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua9dbfde4" id="ua9dbfde4"><span data-lake-id="u1518efe1" id="u1518efe1">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ue469976b" id="ue469976b"> Ho 等人将潜变量的推断过程建模为一类由递减序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%5ET%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F50c9194aec3dfaa5a38a0108ae95f297.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J04Kg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b8c9992" id="u4b8c9992">参数化的高斯马尔可夫链</span></p><p data-lake-id="u82043436" id="u82043436" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20where%20%7D%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cleft(%201%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F990a5fd2d3569e4c3eabf239bf83e1ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22meJon%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4eba1a25"><li fid="u03898cb5" data-lake-id="ueb9c2c6f" id="ueb9c2c6f"><span data-lake-id="u3213dcae" id="u3213dcae">由于该过程以自回归方式将样本从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lPFUC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb37e36a" id="udb37e36a">逐步演化至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fWnep%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84db225b" id="u84db225b">，因此被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4b030610" id="u4b030610">前向过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2007d678" id="u2007d678">。直观而言，前向过程不断向观测样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18b6117da832bd74fdb2b88d8f4ad17b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y0nx9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb0bcd76" id="ubb0bcd76">中注入噪声，使其逐步退化为近似纯噪声的状态</span></li><li fid="u03898cb5" data-lake-id="ub9e5ae72" id="ub9e5ae72"><span data-lake-id="ub35e97e6" id="ub35e97e6">与之对应，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3f37530" id="ua3f37530">潜变量模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a4ae4146b74f50892bdc631811ecd06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JWzhx%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1df3d8b8" id="u1df3d8b8">则描述一个从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oQZpE%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7b0f91c" id="ua7b0f91c">逐步生成至</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D9bfJ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uac4ffd91" id="uac4ffd91">的马尔可夫链，其目标在于逼近难以直接求解的逆条件分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F15eb89bf15af4d8159683bf69e9cde8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2tDF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufba2c019" id="ufba2c019">，因此被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua44f4304" id="ua44f4304">生成过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4d644838" id="u4d644838">。从直观上看，生成过程正是对受噪样本逐步执行去噪，以恢复原始数据结构</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9946b8e9" id="u9946b8e9"><span data-lake-id="ue08f6add" id="ue08f6add">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ua936b3f2" id="ua936b3f2"> 前向扩散过程的一项关键性质是，给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85dc97ce1d819eacb00f66dbe120b56f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bZKAG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2579a757" id="u2579a757">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QMexm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6df9171a" id="u6df9171a">的条件分布具有闭式高斯形式，因此可表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sM6S2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc32d71f" id="udc32d71f">与标准高斯噪声的线性组合。该性质揭示前向过程逐步加噪的本质，也简化训练与采样推导。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d6981db065c65d471a82bee4f8e565e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TCq6U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua73b8494" id="ua73b8494">足够接近于零时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_T%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9074020907aea9301bc2a61e9c77f9b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rg1VG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6471c6cb" id="u6471c6cb">收敛到标准高斯分布，故通常设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_T)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a7722dcbccc5c39acfcfe1eb38edf14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rWFOO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u97d70523" id="u97d70523" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t)I)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa18ed3700ac891226755241cfa2a8ec5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YFqMt%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue0708223" id="ue0708223" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20I).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbc46d8a317886348a53e434ee2f04f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bD6wa%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4a06319c" id="u4a06319c"><span data-lake-id="uf6ee2f8a" id="uf6ee2f8a">5️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uc4ef41a9" id="uc4ef41a9"> 当各步条件分布均被建模为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f39a539" id="u9f39a539">具有可学习均值、固定方差的高斯分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufa625409" id="ufa625409">时，变分目标可以进一步化简为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1aaddb99" id="u1aaddb99" style="color: #664900">加权去噪回归目标</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u94c68683" id="u94c68683">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7c371e1f" id="u7c371e1f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cgamma_t%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%2C%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c13326eebaeee016a19902fe91a518c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZCHOZ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u346638de"><li fid="u222e418d" data-lake-id="uadd55737" id="uadd55737"><span data-lake-id="u871fd3b5" id="u871fd3b5">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%3D%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff67a7730f49bd47bdb50609415972880.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tEkMs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d8f1bd3" id="u8d8f1bd3">表示一组按时间步索引的可训练函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%3A%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec6d708125f81f8fbab4e65826de2492.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ReFNM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda6710a2" id="uda6710a2">用于预测在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RQE5W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e5d0b11" id="u0e5d0b11">注入的噪声，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%3D%5B%5C%5Cgamma_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cgamma_T%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fde2f0afe985fdb8015d1e6d44a4169.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oCiS1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b34abcc" id="u9b34abcc">为由噪声调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_%7B1%3AT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74b7500fea4f42a2364fc12bbcf1846b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zD7i6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0e0f678" id="ub0e0f678">决定的正权重系数。由此，模型训练可等价地理解为：在不同噪声水平下，让网络学习从受扰动样本中恢复对应的高斯噪声。Ho 等人实际采用的是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcfae9450fdf54b574831d26d4a0ad7f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J8M0r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u855bf887" id="u855bf887">的简化目标，以获得更好的生成性能；这一形式也与噪声条件 score 网络中基于 score matching 的训练目标一致</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ude24ee84" id="ude24ee84"><span data-lake-id="u7432a667" id="u7432a667">前向过程的长度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tG9I7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc536f00" id="ucc536f00">是去噪扩散概率模型中的一个关键超参数。从变分推断的角度看，较大的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jBF2m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0c1cd4c" id="ue0c1cd4c">有助于使逆过程更接近高斯分布，从而使基于高斯条件分布建模的生成过程成为更合理的近似。例如 Ho 等人采用 T=1000 的设定。然而，生成阶段必须按时间顺序逐步执行全部</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oyPWF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u940dcf32" id="u940dcf32">次迭代，而无法并行完成，因此去噪扩散概率模型的采样速度显著慢于其他深度生成模型</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="g2iUp" id="g2iUp" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9096d587" id="u9096d587">🌱</span><span data-lake-id="u0063799a" id="u0063799a"> 𝑽𝑨𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵𝑨𝑳 𝑰𝑵𝑭𝑬𝑹𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝑵𝑶𝑵-𝑴𝑨𝑹𝑲𝑶𝑽𝑰𝑨𝑵 𝑭𝑶𝑹𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑫 𝑷𝑹𝑶𝑪𝑬𝑺𝑺𝑬𝑺</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u20223e22" id="u20223e22"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf1a4e67" id="ubf1a4e67"> 由于生成模型旨在逼近推断过程的逆过程，为减少生成模型在采样时所需的迭代次数，有必要重新思考推断过程的构造方式</span></strong></p><ul list="u4b84a612"><li fid="u0d00f656" data-lake-id="u2d4c56a5" id="u2d4c56a5"><span data-lake-id="uf24237c0" id="uf24237c0">DDPM 的训练目标虽然源自对推断分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F728ff608f91e0d6f3ee4cede450684a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QWBPe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8cdf9b0" id="ub8cdf9b0">的建模，但其化简后的代理目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d5ae91049136a9c85f81daa0a6751f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VErcv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ee3e315" id="u8ee3e315">实际上</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1e6a5cb0" id="u1e6a5cb0" style="color: #101E60">不直接依赖联合分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F728ff608f91e0d6f3ee4cede450684a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H32XD%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><span data-lake-id="ueaf1bbe1" id="ueaf1bbe1">，而只依赖各时刻的边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b53ce474cbf219b56239bd15baa96bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VZlzn%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u0d00f656" data-lake-id="u3a106068" id="u3a106068"><span data-lake-id="u1e451310" id="u1e451310">DDIM 的理论基础在于如下关键事实：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u58b378d0" id="u58b378d0" style="color: #70000D">DDPM 的代理目标</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d5ae91049136a9c85f81daa0a6751f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AwDz4%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d930a65" id="u6d930a65" style="color: #70000D">仅依赖边缘分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b53ce474cbf219b56239bd15baa96bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22avI27%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3ad54a34" id="u3ad54a34" style="color: #70000D">，而不直接依赖联合分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F728ff608f91e0d6f3ee4cede450684a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eXRKh%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u386ccd03" id="u386ccd03" style="color: #70000D">。由于存在多种具有相同边缘分布的联合推断过程，论文得以将原有马尔可夫扩散过程推广为非马尔可夫形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u96bfc4e2" id="u96bfc4e2">，并在保持训练目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c25c154e6f7c2721f6785dded8d3863.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PWo3c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3f75f07" id="ud3f75f07">不变的前提下，构造出新的逆向生成过程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4338d843" id="u4338d843"><span data-lake-id="u01939153" id="u01939153">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u85f876c9" id="u85f876c9"> 作者进一步构造一族由参数向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5Cge%200%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54eea560e4bfd22c407abb67c559c4bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NfahK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1e5623e" id="ub1e5623e">索引的推断分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EP43g%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64ebe2d0" id="u64ebe2d0">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2a36e64d" id="u2a36e64d">用于在保持各时刻边缘分布不变的前提下，将原有的马尔可夫推断过程推广为更一般的非马尔可夫形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u56d42a48" id="u56d42a48">。具体而言，该族推断分布定义为</span></p><p data-lake-id="uae2f1918" id="uae2f1918" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5ET%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb96e7ca573178192cb83f658b682f9ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FVN9c%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1b606338"><li fid="ue8c4490f" data-lake-id="u37117502" id="u37117502"><span data-lake-id="u54fc91c1" id="u54fc91c1">其中终点分布满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(x_T%20%7C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_T%7D%20x_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_T)I)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e034710c33b1c4114e250c96bd27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gWRmp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5810148b" id="u5810148b">且对任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6bad1212292211d80f2f649c77d46187.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22akPYX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf858fc3" id="uaf858fc3">，其条件分布定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uae36796e" id="uae36796e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%7C%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec92e9d45277418a4114795fbe1a52b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22clHCz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9e646850"><li fid="u86946689" data-lake-id="u8fbddd00" id="u8fbddd00"><span data-lake-id="uee1f578a" id="uee1f578a">均值函数经过专门设计，对任意时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MKIz3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a7adf97" id="u8a7adf97">，该推断过程始终满足与原扩散过程一致的边缘分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub46e21f9" id="ub46e21f9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5C%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)I%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0be20481304ca90042b68f8fe5f6f2d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iQHD8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1fafc3b9" id="u1fafc3b9"><span data-lake-id="uf129d140" id="uf129d140">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u99ac2d1d" id="u99ac2d1d"> 由 Bayes 公式可进一步导出对应的前向过程仍为高斯分布。但与 DDPM 中的马尔可夫扩散过程不同，这里的前向过程一般依赖于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d8baf6861f4df36eba52b385984c38c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gNwZ2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9af04cb" id="ub9af04cb">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JgbZg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5714448e" id="u5714448e">，因而具有非马尔可夫性。参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff776541cc2d3c0085d4f7a96bc6c872f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VruwW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b044016" id="u5b044016">用于控制过程的随机程度；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u76cfd898" id="u76cfd898" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">特别地，当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cto%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40ed4759aad4775216e58e358008ba0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VCQ2r%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u659b0111" id="u659b0111" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">时，前向过程将趋于确定性</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5c387a42" id="u5c387a42" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%2Cx_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%5C%5C%2Cq_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%7D%7B%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6904ab1de3f9f78d7a06d6174af03e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aEa0h%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u584477c8" id="u584477c8"><span data-lake-id="ud35229ba" id="ud35229ba">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uc9e6efe0" id="uc9e6efe0"> 在此基础上，进一步定义一个可训练的生成过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F69c1bc306b70f8dd7a400367d8fdbf0f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IbXiq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u816c8cb1" id="u816c8cb1">，其中每一步条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F090b7ea67b22c07fb630a517def8de58.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C7Y8g%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u491e40e8" id="u491e40e8">的构造都利用已知的逆条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40ddc1a9ca8b4ba2b578b7ed5ce7665d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IUyp4%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1a8d8a10"><li fid="ucc79a153" data-lake-id="u2acc2ae8" id="u2acc2ae8"><strong><span data-lake-id="udfe5eac3" id="udfe5eac3" style="color: #5C0036">基本思想：对于给定的受噪样本</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pPSFA%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u961287ec" id="u961287ec" style="color: #5C0036">，模型首先预测与之对应的原始样本</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IYl5W%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4b11f24" id="ub4b11f24" style="color: #5C0036">，再将该预测结果代入先前定义的逆条件分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40ddc1a9ca8b4ba2b578b7ed5ce7665d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JqP16%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u250f0437" id="u250f0437" style="color: #5C0036">中，从而得到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d8baf6861f4df36eba52b385984c38c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aEkal%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue809bde1" id="ue809bde1" style="color: #5C0036">的采样结果。换言之，生成过程的每一步都可理解为先估计干净样本，再依据逆条件分布执行一步去噪更新</span></strong></li></ul><card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Qwc5t%22%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u45bac9bd" id="u45bac9bd"><span data-lake-id="u7937130a" id="u7937130a">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ub4424b5f" id="ub4424b5f"> 由前向扩散过程可知，给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8ec1fd51c7226588dc1c1d241da70d9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22klqNw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d680161" id="u7d680161">及高斯噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa79844d6f220de1ddeb68a165e887320.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22adLMh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a828e6b" id="u9a828e6b">，时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZwU95%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u368ceff4" id="u368ceff4">的噪声样本可表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2Cx_0%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3446bed0af8725c8717a7e1b8f91cb3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TcQ3h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93bc298d" id="u93bc298d">据此，模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4082dc644d7ead3d1322f64ab263c173.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uvDtU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d41fb0f" id="u6d41fb0f">在不显式利用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85dc97ce1d819eacb00f66dbe120b56f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g7Ohf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8508dad0" id="u8508dad0">的情况下，仅通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa21cf1a7c05261064879de9d8c2557bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ccjrg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60db1181" id="u60db1181">对噪声项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5224f76243e6699c0e344808d9208a25.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YhOff%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee4f78ee" id="uee4f78ee">进行估计。进一步地，对上述关系进行重排，可得到对原始样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QjE3J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cf72514" id="u0cf72514">的去噪估计：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8635655b" id="u8635655b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ca949db0c912a375e1d8e90385a30f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OZlRE%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uabf5f0c2" id="uabf5f0c2"><span data-lake-id="uf43c21bb" id="uf43c21bb">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u6bcb8a87" id="u6bcb8a87"> 进一步地，在获得对干净样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eaYo6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61a73f39" id="u61a73f39">的估计之后，便可以据此构造对应的反向生成过程。其基本思想是：从终点的标准高斯先验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bi7BV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7836a639" id="u7836a639">出发，沿时间步逐步执行反向采样，并在每一步利用模型给出的去噪估计</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58272aa5868779d7793a24435c1b21ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gueKe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufd01afed" id="ufd01afed">来近似刻画从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YoUw5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2d1c1a6e" id="u2d1c1a6e">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d8baf6861f4df36eba52b385984c38c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bNOWh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57e86843" id="u57e86843">的条件分布。在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22up9ay%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d72cfca" id="u1d72cfca">时额外加入一个协方差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%20I%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbffdd2fe770a125c530612a3648625a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ESeie%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3109bd3f" id="u3109bd3f">的高斯扰动，其作用是保证生成过程在整个空间上都具有良好的支撑。且其逐步反向转移分布为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4f95d3ef" id="u4f95d3ef" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(1)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_1)%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20t%20%3D%201%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t))%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%2C%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffe153758eccd3e0e1fc9dc9a5c9a14de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H7ycN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1093eb6a" id="u1093eb6a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9f978628" id="u9f978628">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ue7481687" id="ue7481687"> 在给定生成模型的定义之后，模型参数的学习可被表述为一个标准的变分推断问题。通过最小化模型生成路径与真实扩散路径之间的差异，使反向生成过程尽可能逼近真实的逆扩散过程。尽管从形式上看，不同的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ott5R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf069248" id="ubf069248">会诱导出不同的目标函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff542b45bebf343d1d55e1158cfb566c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nW6nT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60bfcbd2" id="u60bfcbd2">，但作者进一步证明，该目标实际上可等价转化为某种加权形式的训练损失</span></p><p data-lake-id="u56a1c316" id="u56a1c316" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cgamma_t%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%2C%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c13326eebaeee016a19902fe91a518c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MU4wh%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udf938f6f" id="udf938f6f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnJ_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta)%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%20%5B%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdcfe780b6112b320cecd5fb1abb7d894.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E35V3%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua1895c15" id="ua1895c15"><em><strong><span data-lake-id="ua306f502" id="ua306f502" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">Theorem 1.   对任意</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc76ebfad44ce6b4748b32a6571abc199.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LNjra%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><em><strong><span data-lake-id="ubbcf7605" id="ubbcf7605" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">，都存在某个权重向量</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff08541f18d09f67175d812e146c8a738.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GXUOp%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f1b58d8" id="u4f1b58d8" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">以及常数</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07b16da136b4790276788e3825c2db7b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22teLIj%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u4fafe991" id="u4fafe991" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">，使得</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%3DL_%5C%5Cgamma%2BC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9134274cfb19bc45d62d1f1342300293.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bbqjh%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card></p><ul list="u90588383"><li fid="ucf77612a" data-lake-id="u7585e68f" id="u7585e68f"><span data-lake-id="u61830fee" id="u61830fee">这一定理表明，变分目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff542b45bebf343d1d55e1158cfb566c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TSHTN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34607e66" id="u34607e66">本质上可以写成某个加权损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F63f085b47d25a840051e919303b12b91.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZ2dC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffa41e6a" id="uffa41e6a">与一个常数项之和。由于常数项不影响优化过程，因此从优化角度来看，最小化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff542b45bebf343d1d55e1158cfb566c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZsHWZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8deffadd" id="u8deffadd">与最小化相应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d5ae91049136a9c85f81daa0a6751f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ffdeu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac2b7804" id="uac2b7804">是等价的</span></li><li fid="ucf77612a" data-lake-id="u39c250f2" id="u39c250f2"><span data-lake-id="udded1611" id="udded1611">进一步地，变分目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F63f085b47d25a840051e919303b12b91.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iZYGO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0975f893" id="u0975f893">具有一个特殊性质：如果模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a99807442ae156cc378190ce4ae6deb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mKEWT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9524c6e5" id="u9524c6e5">在不同时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jjnlq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32bdc6d9" id="u32bdc6d9">上</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1ddbb679" id="u1ddbb679">不共享参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u07d168e2" id="u07d168e2">，那么</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e49f6f0f8deead694119ae9022b3641.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lcb5M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf862164" id="udf862164">的最优解将不依赖于权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gk6aG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u256d4478" id="u256d4478">。这是因为，此时全局最优可以通过分别优化求和中的每一项来实现，因此各项前的权重并不会改变最终的最优解</span></li><li fid="ucf77612a" data-lake-id="ude8e9450" id="ude8e9450"><span data-lake-id="u8af014cd" id="u8af014cd">这一性质带来两点重要推论。一方面，它解释为什么在 DDPM 中可以使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_1%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8539aa6b21c30377388e629415653c49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IFDVl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f452df3" id="u4f452df3">作为变分下界的替代目标函数；另一方面，由于根据定理 1，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff542b45bebf343d1d55e1158cfb566c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jOdSo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46774704" id="u46774704">与某个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d5ae91049136a9c85f81daa0a6751f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZS02Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9662b8da" id="u9662b8da">是等价的，因此</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff542b45bebf343d1d55e1158cfb566c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22upUjX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c1d9445" id="u6c1d9445">的最优解也与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8774782e75650651e5d3a5ded5c77e44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wDOjZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d67522e" id="u6d67522e">的最优解一致。由此可知，当模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e49f6f0f8deead694119ae9022b3641.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bzv4V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4b5fa6a" id="ud4b5fa6a">在不同时间步之间不共享参数时，Ho 等人（2020）所采用的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8774782e75650651e5d3a5ded5c77e44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GWNGw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u031476fc" id="u031476fc">目标，同样可以作为变分目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff542b45bebf343d1d55e1158cfb566c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vEKnl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9edfd52b" id="u9edfd52b">的替代优化目标</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="ec8Zn" id="ec8Zn" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8b91433e" id="u8b91433e">🦋</span><span data-lake-id="u534bd401" id="u534bd401"> 𝑺𝑨𝑴𝑷𝑳𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑭𝑹𝑶𝑴 𝑮𝑬𝑵𝑬𝑹𝑨𝑳𝑰𝒁𝑬𝑫 𝑮𝑬𝑵𝑬𝑹𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑽𝑬 𝑷𝑹𝑶𝑪𝑬𝑺𝑺𝑬𝑺</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0a4fd91d" id="u0a4fd91d"><span data-lake-id="u417013b0" id="u417013b0">当采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8774782e75650651e5d3a5ded5c77e44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dz3xh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f2eac2f" id="u2f2eac2f">作为优化目标时，模型实际上学习到的并非仅是针对经典马尔可夫推断过程的生成规律，而是同时适用于一类更广泛的、由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gx3Gd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6374dace" id="u6374dace">所刻画的非马尔可夫前向过程。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2a05791" id="ud2a05791" style="color: #004347">换言之，DDPM 训练所得模型具有超出原始马尔可夫框架的适用性，可以自然迁移到这些新的生成目标之中。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99446997" id="u99446997">因此，相较于重新学习参数化模型，一个更关键的问题在于如何通过调整</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JVpfZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc0ccdc8" id="ucc0ccdc8">来重塑生成过程本身，以获得在采样效率、样本质量或生成特性方面更符合需求的结果</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud42cc3ed" id="ud42cc3ed" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774322805173-884b58ac-f16b-4721-bbf9-f756e9947b4e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0b8ca105-424c-42f7-b8f3-ebeb02c2417%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u45a86a10-7f09-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A418.4%2C%22height%22%3A126%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A19709%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A523%2C%22originHeight%22%3A157%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22G(0301%2C00)%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(32200%22%2C%22x%22%3A225%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2203%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C0%22%2C%22x%22%3A465%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2203%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PE%22%2C%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TaOFO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubccc1c21" id="ubccc1c21"> </span></p><p data-lake-id="ucb622be3" id="ucb622be3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4a2ef72d" id="u4a2ef72d" style="color: #101E60">DDIM 将 DDPM 的反向采样公式推广为一族由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47db06c23eda0f320721582da4e8a231.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mcUfv%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f21f0d0" id="u7f21f0d0" style="color: #101E60">控制的生成过程。在这一框架下，模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e49f6f0f8deead694119ae9022b3641.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TRUpZ%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u71aa4aaa" id="u71aa4aaa" style="color: #101E60">保持不变，变化的只是采样路径本身。因此，DDPM 训练得到的模型不仅可以用于原始的随机马尔可夫采样，也可以通过重新设定</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%CF%83t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb43a6f517be30affe6b8018bbc77fb8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uhGOO%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c10d4e8" id="u4c10d4e8" style="color: #101E60">来实现不同形式的生成过程</span></strong></p><ul list="u4685e845"><li fid="u47134a53" data-lake-id="u5cee619c" id="u5cee619c"><span data-lake-id="u82005f0b" id="u82005f0b">根据定义的生成分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B1%3AT%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe348a2e91b331f498b7afff2cb4d859b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YZaJD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3e76c40" id="uf3e76c40">，可以由当前时刻的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GIbZO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u099a9d80" id="u099a9d80">生成前一时刻样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d8baf6861f4df36eba52b385984c38c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JZpn9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41c7a479" id="u41c7a479">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_t%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa46baee10691302564ed53491b58f49e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iEKkK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufda37a41" id="ufda37a41">为与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P2Rbh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ae42692" id="u5ae42692">相互独立的标准高斯噪声，并约定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_0%3A%3D1.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7579caf9cf63a009591dc1647512e73e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xRECd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69f2099b" id="u69f2099b">其采样形式为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u93b60577" id="u93b60577" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E7%9A%84%20%7Dx_0%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%20%7Dx_t%5C%5Ctext%7B%20%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%E9%A1%B9%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cepsilon_t%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E9%9A%8F%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%AA%E5%A3%B0%7D%7D%2C%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F233ea82bbc7674ea15a8f89b55e5b2a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pviu0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua360c45f"><li fid="u3526116b" data-lake-id="uea02c988" id="uea02c988"><span data-lake-id="uff9ae041" id="uff9ae041">由上式可知，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jE8tI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube69e4cc" id="ube69e4cc">取不同取值时，将对应不同的生成过程；然而，这些不同的生成过程均可建立在同一个噪声预测模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e49f6f0f8deead694119ae9022b3641.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wpy2l%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc18d9945" id="uc18d9945">之上，因此无需重新训练模型参数。当对所有时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vJmzQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0e55eef" id="ua0e55eef">都取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbc2e5bb1a243ecd61ca403ba70bd7db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PtW9u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf5fcbca7" id="uf5fcbca7">则相应的前向过程退化为马尔可夫过程，而此时的生成过程即对应于 DDPM</span></li><li fid="u3526116b" data-lake-id="u2d89d71d" id="u2d89d71d"><span data-lake-id="u27cd49a8" id="u27cd49a8">另一方面，还存在一个特殊情形，即对所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pHE9K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20c884bf" id="u20c884bf">取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F301611f06c74a08f130767153c42d4bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MVprc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua524c0f6" id="ua524c0f6">。此时，除</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xzKqN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67a061b8" id="u67a061b8">外，前向过程在给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6b4b6242eaf247264a4e5dc6d13f920.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZMQbu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefbb45bf" id="uefbb45bf">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MiY8T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9cd417a" id="ue9cd417a">的条件下是确定性的；同时，在生成过程中，随机噪声项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd46c33f7e15b48b923c3b849ea69f432.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qFlHo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96f4a70b" id="u96f4a70b">前的系数变为零，因此采样过程不再包含额外随机扰动。由此得到的模型成为一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u319b9970" id="u319b9970">隐式概率模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u19d321fe" id="u19d321fe">，其样本通过一个固定的映射过程由潜变量逐步生成，即从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l2mhG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30d5863c" id="u30d5863c">确定性地映射至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n8QOg%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue177f8e5" id="ue177f8e5"><strong><span data-lake-id="udee9e1d6" id="udee9e1d6">在前述各节中，生成过程被视为对逆过程的近似。由于前向过程包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VP5Tk%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud417f157" id="ud417f157">个时间步，因此生成过程也相应地被设定为执行</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ItGEo%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc90592cd" id="uc90592cd">步采样。然而，由于去噪目标</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8774782e75650651e5d3a5ded5c77e44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fj95Q%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uda8b0df0" id="uda8b0df0">并不依赖于具体的前向过程形式，只要边缘分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba6efda527eb37589f2b666da88e808c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LXsaY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1487f066" id="u1487f066">保持固定，我们便可以进一步考虑长度小于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DrOop%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud017f77e" id="ud017f77e">的前向过程，从而在无需重新训练模型的前提下，加速相应的生成过程</span></strong></p><ul list="ud95a9a46"><li fid="ub5ec754a" data-lake-id="ueb36644c" id="ueb36644c"><span data-lake-id="ubcfdbed1" id="ubcfdbed1">具体而言，不再在全部潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7B1%3AT%7D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F889b2cc87533eb136e2c41d30cff7347.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22loMME%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba2d1848" id="uba2d1848">上定义前向过程，而仅在其子集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx_%7B%5C%5Ctau_1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_%7B%5C%5Ctau_S%7D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb16c7b5aacbccd2b514bcd302421727e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fNLeF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c9f471e" id="u8c9f471e">上进行定义，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AcT27%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3c1c113" id="ue3c1c113">是从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72ef74008dbbd054a36e00fa53b070e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t2fBR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a841abf" id="u3a841abf">中选取的一个长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kBCtv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua54aebfe" id="ua54aebfe">的严格递增子序列。特别地，在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7B%5C%5Ctau_1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_%7B%5C%5Ctau_S%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe73d3b470839ee75869511513a34916a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jgaKY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa8dd4cd" id="uaa8dd4cd">上定义顺序前向过程，使其满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5C%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D)I%5C%5Cbigr)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1229a4331229cc3d10d08c1107f41089.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKQYn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5bce8c40" id="u5bce8c40">即保证其边缘分布与原始过程相匹配。在这种设定下，生成过程将按照</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Breversed%7D(%5C%5Ctau)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F03293f6f88da0c73d0f10ccd2097f6ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AIQM5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u348f0729" id="u348f0729">的顺序对潜变量进行采样，这一采样序列被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9af12dd2" id="u9af12dd2">采样轨迹</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u110ea7c4" id="u110ea7c4">。当采样轨迹的长度显著小于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f8giJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u634ddefc" id="u634ddefc">时，由于采样过程本身具有迭代性质，计算效率便可得到显著提升</span></li><li fid="ub5ec754a" data-lake-id="u4b87057a" id="u4b87057a"><span data-lake-id="u065c5ff2" id="u065c5ff2">从原则上讲，可以在训练阶段采用任意数量的前向扩散步数，而在生成阶段只使用其中的一部分步数进行采样。由此，训练得到的模型不仅能够考虑比 Ho 等人所使用设定更多的时间步，甚至还可以推广到连续时间变量的情形</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u69e36958" id="u69e36958"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud27a5351" id="ud27a5351" style="color: #4C16B1">通过将 DDIM 更新公式重写为 Euler 型离散形式，作者表明 DDIM 本质上是在离散求解一个确定性的 ODE；因此，DDIM 不仅能够从噪声生成样本，还能够将样本反向映射为潜变量表示，这也是其区别于 DDPM 的一个重要性质</span></strong></p><ul list="u70c359a0"><li fid="uda6033bd" data-lake-id="u631a08df" id="u631a08df"><span data-lake-id="ufc86be66" id="ufc86be66">将 DDIM 的迭代更新形式改写为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7Dx_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7Dx_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9eb48c55adfce538fae44a4860e4ce9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QBtW9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8eeec456" id="u8eeec456">，使其与求解 ODE 时的 Euler 积分方法之间的相似性更加直观：进一步地，可以将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e824e51e5fb5373c71ff6a7ac301be3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MnGD0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ac00df5" id="u0ac00df5">重新参数化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cDRXT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7712e014" id="u7712e014">，并将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26fd4da062ccf68170d9ff0d3cd215f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cNR23%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4f2742d" id="ue4f2742d">记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20H(%5C%5Clambda)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d48706ece8afc2bfbc4fb75f5156107.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z6yx3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2940fd37" id="u2940fd37">。在此参数化下，从噪声状态采样得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZHZp3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf23d52f8" id="uf23d52f8">的过程，可以被视为对如下常微分方程进行积分，M 为一个足够大的正数，对应于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%5C%5Capprox%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd37193dec52e9a975c30cc9fe7291da3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CXZDs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1f1542ce" id="u1f1542ce">的情形</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud603ab57" id="ud603ab57" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H(0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint_%7BM%7D%5E%7B0%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(H(%5C%5Clambda)%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Clambda%5E2%20-%201%7D)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda%20%2B%20H(M)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20H(M)%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe928d0a0838acfad8cfa9f727b435c0d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tHfpD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u70c359a0" start="2"><li fid="uda6033bd" data-lake-id="uf063830b" id="uf063830b"><span data-lake-id="u5a88b510" id="u5a88b510">当离散时间步数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wuw7L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e86a7eb" id="u6e86a7eb">足够大时，不仅可以将 DDIM 视为对上述 ODE 的离散化求解，而且还可以反向执行这一生成过程，即从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HsGVe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf76f8b25" id="uf76f8b25">推进到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3DT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8327b3b12defea7a27228e80772e8d03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wPDxX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u680a4a99" id="u680a4a99">，从而将观测样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t4bPl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubbfbd42d" id="ubbfbd42d">编码为潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NjKYe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udcc758f1" id="udcc758f1">，这一过程对应于模拟 ODE 的逆过程。由此可见，与 DDPM 不同，DDIM 不仅可以用于生成样本，还能够将观测数据映射到潜在表示空间中，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t6L5a%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u470cca00" id="u470cca00">的形式获得其隐变量表示</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="gg7Mz" id="gg7Mz" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ubc2ae643" id="ubc2ae643">🦋</span><span data-lake-id="ua7f42cbb" id="ua7f42cbb"> 𝑫𝑫𝑰𝑴 𝑻𝒂𝒌𝒆𝒂𝒘𝒂𝒚  </span></h2><p data-lake-id="u670ccb17" id="u670ccb17"><strong><span data-lake-id="u289aadcc" id="u289aadcc">DDPM 的采样瓶颈：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u73bd04c7" id="u73bd04c7">DDPM 的生成过程本质上是对一个长链式反向马尔可夫过程进行逐步模拟，因此在采样时通常需要经历从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O6ggf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ac48d0b" id="u5ac48d0b">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22foLe7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u089767dc" id="u089767dc">的完整迭代链条。由于每一步都依赖于前一时刻的状态，并伴随随机噪声采样，这种逐步去噪方式虽然能够保证生成质量，但推理代价较高，采样速度较慢</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0b3075c6" id="u0b3075c6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u51f12df5" id="u51f12df5">DDIM 的基本出发点：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub47b1188" id="ub47b1188">DDIM 的关键观察在于：扩散模型训练时真正依赖的并不是完整的马尔可夫前向链，而是任意时刻关于原始样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wPDtW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua16b12f9" id="ua16b12f9">的边缘分布</span></p><ul list="udba52af4"><li fid="u31569966" data-lake-id="u82d9bdd6" id="u82d9bdd6"><span data-lake-id="udbf5b86a" id="udbf5b86a">具体而言，只要满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5C%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)I%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F78eaf05bec289393628dbcf9aed9a8fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YLb9m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb179355" id="udb179355">则对应的训练目标就可以保持不变。也就是说，模型训练所依赖的是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t6WoL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2c6cefb" id="ub2c6cefb">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iYIkG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udbfc71da" id="udbfc71da">之间的直接关系，而不是中间状态之间必须如何逐步转移。因此，前向过程并不一定需要严格满足 DDPM 所采用的马尔可夫结构</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf62e7ef7" id="uf62e7ef7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u90272c7f" id="u90272c7f">非马尔可夫前向过程的构造：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u17ac715b" id="u17ac715b">基于这一点，DDIM 将前向过程推广为一类关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZcY36%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u038b7853" id="u038b7853">条件化的非马尔可夫过程，其联合分布写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2092b965" id="u2092b965" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_T%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7Dq_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab8efefbf3c1cfc92b3bf45e733572cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lqDDg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf0b4c9cf"><li fid="ufe75771f" data-lake-id="u54db960b" id="u54db960b"><span data-lake-id="ufe7f9006" id="ufe7f9006">其中各步条件分布定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud2af74c1" id="ud2af74c1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24d105ca4688ff6888c1daa59fc0b3cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KvKgC%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud20c553c"><li fid="uc3ca1963" data-lake-id="u17659c8c" id="u17659c8c"><span data-lake-id="u67fdf13e" id="u67fdf13e">这一构造虽然改变前向过程的路径分解方式，但并没有改变各时刻的边缘分布，因为仍然有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5C%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)I%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c0460efa6acfe4f668d24a2cf7560bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CMJh9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9fe4dc87" id="u9fe4dc87">因此，DDIM 与 DDPM 可以共享相同的训练目标，而无需重新训练模型</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u092b5742" id="u092b5742"><strong><span data-lake-id="u50d9aae2" id="u50d9aae2">训练目标仍然是噪声预测：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud694d95e" id="ud694d95e">在这种构造下，相应的变分目标仍可化为与 DDPM 相同形式的加权噪声预测损失，即</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue9aace9b" id="ue9aace9b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cgamma_t%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_t%7D%20%5C%5CBigl%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cepsilon_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)-%5C%5Cepsilon_t%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5CBigr%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c801778f8101c3b33ed81dd1331f8c2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JdIfh%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8d3d89ca" id="u8d3d89ca"><strong><span data-lake-id="udee13cf2" id="udee13cf2">DDIM 的采样形式：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0d78bb07" id="u0d78bb07">在反向生成时，DDIM 首先由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22osPZT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u295442ff" id="u295442ff">预测</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K2D4v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb843763" id="udb843763">，记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20x_0%3Df_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ad7103ad3b3fad1d826673bc08b9482.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e8jRp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d6ebcc9" id="u4d6ebcc9">，再利用该预测构造</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d8baf6861f4df36eba52b385984c38c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZG2Z0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u079dbec2" id="u079dbec2">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ube1386c4" id="ube1386c4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Chat%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Chat%20x_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cepsilon_t.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F358fef6c318b4e63ad1b0212aa9ec197.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T0oSm%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5b2f9fd1"><li fid="u7898310f" data-lake-id="u05e3af31" id="u05e3af31"><span data-lake-id="uf6365ce4" id="uf6365ce4">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47db06c23eda0f320721582da4e8a231.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PEybm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0627efac" id="u0627efac">控制采样过程中的随机性。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F89c83a16595ab6b11e402963b2d72b23.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G8DJ5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u75d36b74" id="u75d36b74">时，生成过程仍然保留一定随机扰动；而当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F301611f06c74a08f130767153c42d4bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SXoNj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uef4c12d9" id="uef4c12d9">时，上式退化为确定性映射，此时给定同一个初始噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LmX3V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u097100c9" id="u097100c9">，模型将沿着唯一确定的轨迹生成样本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u75af1ca2" id="u75af1ca2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7Bq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cdelta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cright)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F800680d86ba6b113cd7e17dab8617261.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OFJ2A%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6ac9e45f" id="u6ac9e45f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaeeecfb2" id="uaeeecfb2">DDIM 的核心意义：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f06af87" id="u4f06af87" style="color: #665800">它证明扩散模型的训练目标与具体采样路径并不是强绑定的</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udf4f89f6" id="udf4f89f6">，只要保持</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b53ce474cbf219b56239bd15baa96bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DPio6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaba84776" id="uaba84776">不变，就可以重新设计前向与反向过程。基于这种思想，DDIM 将 DDPM 的随机逐步采样推广为一种更一般的采样框架，并进一步支持确定性、可跳步的快速生成方式，从而在不重新训练模型的前提下显著提升采样效率</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="sMidY" id="sMidY" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4ce18672" id="u4ce18672">☃️</span><span data-lake-id="u73c9872d" id="u73c9872d"> 𝑳𝒆𝒎𝒎𝒂 𝟏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue44ce3c4" id="ue44ce3c4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u57f422cb" id="u57f422cb">DDIM 将前向过程构造为关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wjkTD%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fe82831" id="u8fe82831">的非马尔可夫联合分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_T%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F666746ffbc1c25fcc1018671766ca499.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Itbmy%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9107fbf1" id="u9107fbf1">其中</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u46a5d1d4" id="u46a5d1d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24d105ca4688ff6888c1daa59fc0b3cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pFhej%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf117f8fa" id="uf117f8fa"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0db0112" id="uf0db0112">在该构造下，任意时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BD4SU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2215433b" id="u2215433b">的边缘分布仍满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5C%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)I%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F66963ce2c5b715e1f8f64c966d807859.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yj0I6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9efe381" id="uf9efe381">因此，DDIM 改变的是前向演化路径的分解方式，而不是各时刻的边缘分布，这也保证其能够与 DDPM 共享相同的训练目标</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8b7b0920" id="u8b7b0920"><span data-lake-id="ue6c7d0f9" id="ue6c7d0f9">证明：若假设对于任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cle%20T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf4af66260b08788d4a4ed1c6c0c8976.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uOKz2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u644e2d8d" id="u644e2d8d">，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2CI%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4206b5f6bf33d26ddce2b438fce5567a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TWYcx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7793630" id="ue7793630">若进一步有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5C%2CI%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c66786e522b8c160a14e8fc65e035bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EAGfF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua925bc24" id="ua925bc24"> 则由于基例</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3DT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8327b3b12defea7a27228e80772e8d03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F2xUx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5c733bc" id="ub5c733bc">已经成立，因此可对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TJJ4c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48578c41" id="u48578c41">从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w6rJX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7ef3cd3e" id="u7ef3cd3e">到 1 使用归纳法证明该结论</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9c631934" id="u9c631934"><span data-lake-id="ua91c0571" id="ua91c0571">首先，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7D%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5436f3331ddaf3f8acea9b4f6723f9c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N77nB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6cba2c7b" id="u6cba2c7b"> 并且</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc73b4192" id="uc73b4192" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F324133a61a0554b87347a6dbcc3d1f90.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22esaX1%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua9681694" id="ua9681694" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff32378e30df1872adbbdcdc0900856b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zq1OT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc91b897b" id="uc91b897b">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="uac2d5159" id="uac2d5159"><span data-lake-id="u831d67d8" id="u831d67d8">由 Bishop (2006) 式 (2.115) 可知，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c51c300357122aeaab30ac6693324d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Axl41%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9dbf1d7a" id="u9dbf1d7a">为高斯分布</span></p><p data-lake-id="u00c9d700" id="u00c9d700" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5Bq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa10a21e5028d668b8871e503096f397.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lFdbF%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uac27d6db" id="uac27d6db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCov%7D%5Bq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%20%3D%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17c3564b1939335e972d2d57464ff0fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JuyZU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u217effc4" id="u217effc4"><span data-lake-id="u89c2f193" id="u89c2f193">因此，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5C%2CI%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6931a075145164ca6718275239c7bd7b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tFfdZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc14372ad" id="uc14372ad">从而归纳成立</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="AIuso" id="AIuso" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u55a13f43" id="u55a13f43">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u325e5653" id="u325e5653"> 𝑻𝒉𝒆𝒐𝒓𝒆𝒎 𝟏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud56c7fc5" id="ud56c7fc5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u66201e61" id="u66201e61">对于任意</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F681047c6658891bf73f66f13541641ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R3pit%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4670a4e" id="uf4670a4e">，都存在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa915ec975318fc065026c406467a2229.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5kwV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u64a82a8e" id="u64a82a8e">和常数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07b16da136b4790276788e3825c2db7b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yRZVq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0fa7c255" id="u0fa7c255">，使得</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%3DL_%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D%2BC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7526cf6f93dd3c7310b56e592be6a2ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gmbnR%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6f07c689" id="u6f07c689"><span data-lake-id="ucbbf080d" id="ucbbf080d">证明：由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd61a97c392549ffa39a070f929fbbe2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fOcZ6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d7ec71f" id="u5d7ec71f">的定义可得</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua6ffd888" id="ua6ffd888" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bequation*%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnJ_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta)%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cequiv%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5ET%20D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5C%7C%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t))%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(1)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_1)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bequation*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff62eff09bf66d75e807a8a8fab7bad40.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xb97e%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u67c6b158" id="u67c6b158"><span data-lake-id="uf06ef167" id="uf06ef167">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6bad1212292211d80f2f649c77d46187.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BbA2u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub16cbc4e" id="ub16cbc4e">，有</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc05fca12" id="uc05fca12" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%5BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0))%20%5C%5C%7C%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t))%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%5BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0))%20%5C%5C%7C%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)))%5D%20%5C%5Cequiv%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20-%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Csubstack%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Csq